local _, GQ = ...

-- Quest story paragraphs, keyed by the exact English paragraph.
if GQ.ActiveLocale ~= "zhTW" then
    return
end

local text = GQ.LocaleText
for k, v in pairs({
    ["Garrick Padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the Abbey and across the bridge."] = "加里克·帕德福特是個亡命之徒，幾個星期來一直騷擾我們的農民和商人。有人在葡萄園附近的一間棚屋裡見過他，那裡在修道院以東，過了橋就是。",
    ["Nothing like a day of boar hunting, eh? Though, here in Coldridge Valley, there are so many boars it almost takes the fun out of it. No need to get them charging."] = "沒有什麼比打一天野豬更痛快的了，對吧？不過在這冰冷山谷裡，野豬多得簡直都沒意思了。根本不用去引牠們衝鋒。",
    ["I hate those nasty timber wolves! But I sure like eating wolf steaks... Bring me tough wolf meat and I will exchange it for something you'll find useful."] = "我討厭那些可惡的森林狼！不過我倒是很愛吃狼排……給我帶些堅韌的狼肉來，我會拿點對你有用的東西跟你交換。",
    ["You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm? I'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves."] = "你看起來像是需要點東西來暖手，嗯？我告訴你什麼管用：一雙暖和的好手套。",
    ["Hildelve wrote in his journal that he was attacked by Mangeclaw, a \"huge Ice Claw Bear.\" He drove off the beast, but not before it mauled him savagely."] = "希爾德爾夫在日記裡寫道，他遭到了「巨大的冰爪熊」爛爪的襲擊。他趕跑了那頭野獸，但在那之前已被牠殘忍地撕咬重傷。",
    ["The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess. The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies! So before she comes to our fields...Princess must die!"] = "布拉克威爾家有一頭得過獎的豬，名叫公主。這頭母豬大得嚇人，都是因為牠偷偷溜到這邊吃我的蔬菜才長成那樣的！所以在牠跑到我們的田裡之前……公主必須死！",
    ["I was playing near the Fargodeep Mine, and I think I dropped, er...I mean I saw, the old lady's necklace. Don't ask me how it got there...it wasn't me!"] = "我在法戈深礦坑附近玩的時候，好像弄丟了……呃……我是說我看見了那位老太太的項鍊。別問我它怎麼會在那兒……不是我幹的！",
    ["We believe they are hiding out in the Dagger Hills, plotting their next move. Slay the wretches in the name of The People's Militia."] = "我們相信他們藏在匕首嶺，策劃著下一步行動。以人民民兵團的名義，殺光這些惡棍。",
    ["Look at what has happened to this place! These lands were once occupied by good farm folk. But the damned thieves have driven them all off. Not me, though!"] = "看看這個地方變成什麼樣了！這片土地曾經住著善良的農民。可是該死的盜賊把他們全趕跑了。不過我可沒被趕走！",
    ["Your previous investigations are proof that the Echo Ridge Mine needs purging. Return to the mine and help clear it of kobolds. Waste no time."] = "你先前的調查證明回音山礦坑需要清理。回到礦坑去，幫忙清除裡面的狗頭人。別浪費時間。",
    ["For your shrewdness and valor, I have a marker here that is good for one piece of armor. I want you to take it to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp."] = "為了獎勵你的機智和勇敢，我這裡有一張憑證，可以換一件護甲。我要你把它交給東谷伐木場的莎拉·堤姆伯蓮。",
    ["I must warn you, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."] = "我必須警告你，這件事只能留在我們之間。薩特已經讓我們夠丟臉的了，而這一件離我們實在太近了。",
    ["We heard the cries in the middle of the night. Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams. That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood."] = "我們半夜聽到了慘叫。今天早上，果然，羊群裡少了兩隻公羊。那頭名叫瓦加什的卑鄙野獸一直在掠奪我們的生計。",
    ["I'm on a quest, a quest to make the perfect stout. I know I can do it -- brewing's in my blood. I just need to find the right recipe... The Frostmane trolls grow a plant, shimmerweed, high up in the hills to the east."] = "我正在追求一個目標，釀出完美的烈性黑啤酒。我知道我辦得到——釀酒就在我的血液裡。我只需要找到合適的配方……霜鬃食人妖在東邊山丘高處種了一種植物，叫閃光草。",
    ["Upon further analysis of the Gnomeregan situation, it would appear as though we not only failed to eradicate the troggs but we also happened to turn most of the gnomish race into horrific, mindless, evil-doing leper gnomes."] = "進一步分析諾姆瑞根的情況後，看來我們不但沒能消滅穴居人，還把大部分地精變成了可怕的、沒有頭腦的、作惡多端的痲瘋地精。",
    ["The Silver Stream Mine to the east ran dry long ago. It was converted by the Miners' League into a storage depot, but now Kobolds have moved in, putting their filthy paws on good, Dwarven tools!"] = "東邊的銀溪礦坑早就乾涸了。礦工聯盟把它改成了倉庫，但現在狗頭人搬了進來，把髒爪子伸向了好好的矮人工具！",
    ["One of our greatest struggles is obtaining the natural resources we need to survive. Gold was scarce even in the height of the Alliance's power."] = "我們最大的難題之一，就是取得生存所需的天然資源。即使在聯盟最強盛的時候，黃金也很稀缺。",
    ["Executor Zygand tells me you've been out killing Scarlet Crusaders. Tirisfal Glades is crawling with them."] = "執行者扎伊甘德告訴我，你一直在外面殺血色十字軍。提里斯法林地到處都是他們。",
    ["The Mass Graves, southwest of Garren's Haunt to the north, were made to accommodate the...impressive...number of deaths Tirisfal suffered when the Plague first came."] = "北邊加倫鬼屋西南面的亂葬崗，是為了容納瘟疫剛爆發時提里斯法所遭受的……數量……驚人的死亡而建的。",
    ["The Agamand Mills area has become a foothold for the Scourge. Their strongest point is the Agamand Family Crypt where their local military leader, a skeleton named Captain Dargol, has headquartered."] = "阿加曼德磨坊一帶已成為天譴軍團的立足點。他們最強的據點是阿加曼德家族墓穴，他們當地的軍事首領，一個名叫達戈爾上尉的骷髏，把總部設在那裡。",
    ["Wanted: Maggot Eye! A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken. This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."] = "通緝：蛆眼！就算以豺狼人的標準來看，這也是一頭噁心的野獸。蛆眼因對被遺忘者犯下的罪行被判處死刑。這個卑鄙的惡棍一直在偷盜屍體，供巫妖王的軍隊使用。",
    ["According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."] = "根據貝拉德的日誌，湖泊潛伏者和爬行者身上的苔蘚可能對我們釀造新瘟疫的研究有用。那些野獸棲息在東邊洛達米爾湖的島嶼上。",
    ["As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."] = "隨著我對阿魯高魔法的了解加深，我對這個可憐傻瓜的鄙視也與日俱增。我就快完成對他所謂解藥的研究了。",
    ["It's so cold, now. The Plague of Undeath crawls through my veins like an icy serpent. The Mindless State will be upon me soon. But no doomed destiny will prevent me from serving our Dark Lady."] = "現在好冷。不死瘟疫像一條冰冷的蛇在我血管裡爬行。失去心智的狀態很快就要降臨我身上了。但沒有任何厄運能阻止我侍奉我們的黑暗女王。",
    ["I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."] = "現在我把先知之水交給你。準備好後，在部落營火旁喝下這水。喝下聖水之後，要過一會兒，幻象才會在火前顯現。",
    ["Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."] = "既然我已經有了蜘蛛的毒液，我想要一些活的標本來研究。可惜，捉一隻活的巨型蜘蛛，對你這樣的年輕人來說要求太高了。",
    ["A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."] = "精通狩獵之道的牛頭人明白，獵物並不只是戰利品。平原上的野獸為我們提供生存的手段。",
    ["We are hunters. Down below in Mulgore there is a mighty kodo named Arra'chea."] = "我們是獵人。下面的莫高雷有一頭強大的科多獸，名叫阿拉奇亞。",
    ["The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."] = "首要之事是讓你的脊梁骨硬起來。我可以派你去貧瘠之地獵殺科多獸，不過說實話，你活著對我們更有用。",
    ["Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."] = "看到你為我做的事，我的心堅定了起來。我不能這麼輕易倒下！我必須堅持下去！但我仍無法在沒有幫助的情況下回到洞穴。",
    ["Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."] = "強大的戰士和笨拙的新手都曾倒在蠍子的毒刺之下。你會在這裡西北方發現大量蠍子。",
    ["Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."] = "透過占卜，我看到一件強大的物品藏在燃刃獸穴的深處，由野獸和黑魔法守衛著。它叫做燃刃勳章，你的下一個任務就是找到它並把它帶出獸穴。",
    ["One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."] = "我最敏銳的一名斥候帶回消息，普勞德摩爾艦隊的殘骸仍留在杜洛塔海岸外，提拉加德要塞的正東面。",
    ["... your timing is perfect. I just hope I can compliment your haste as well. I was careless while fighting a few of the venomtails nearby, and one of them stung me deeply."] = "……你來得正是時候。我只希望也能稱讚你的速度。我在和附近幾隻毒尾蠍戰鬥時疏忽大意，其中一隻狠狠螫了我一下。",
    ["Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."] = "小聲點。科卡爾半人馬就在西邊山脊另一側的科卡爾峭壁。",
    ["The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."] = "巫醫札拉贊住在東邊的回音群島。那些島嶼曾是我們的家園。他從那裡派出食人妖到大陸上，對我們的族人施以妖術，把更多人拖入他的控制。",
    ["We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"] = "我們不能讓燃刃軍團在杜洛塔站穩腳跟！我們必須在他們的邪惡蔓延之前消滅他們！",
    ["please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."] = "求求你，你能幫幫我嗎？我兒子克隆幾天前出去打獵，到現在還沒回來。他往西去了貧瘠之地，沿著怒水河獵鱷魚。",
    [". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."] = "燃刃軍團佔據了奧格瑪以東一個名叫骷髏岩的洞穴。他們在洞裡舉行邪惡的儀式，用灼熱項圈灼燒自己的血肉。",
    ["You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."] = "你很有潛力，一定能在部落面前證明自己。也許不久之後，你就會受邀進入偉大的雷霆崖。",
    ["Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"] = "你好，年輕人。你眼中有光，我看得出你渴望回到平原去狩獵。願你為你的氏族帶來榮耀！",
    ["And again, it is your task to perform the ritual of cleansing. Go to the Thunderhorn Water Well, north of the village, and use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem in your ritual."] = "你的任務依然是進行淨化儀式。前往村子北邊的雷角水井，在儀式中使用雷角淨化圖騰。",
    ["According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."] = "根據你從商隊搶救出來的文件，風險投資公司制定了許多計畫，企圖把我們趕出這裡的土地，好讓他們肆無忌憚地掠奪。",
    ["my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."] = "我哥哥很快就要站到血蹄酋長面前，我很榮幸能為他製作頭飾。我鞣製這些皮帶的時候，想請你幫個忙。",
    ["There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."] = "西北面有矮人正在準備挖掘場。他們認為大地裡藏著祕密，這沒錯，但是掏空和玷污大地，不是獲得它教誨的方法。",
    ["The ragged hide of Ghost Howl still bears a terrible wound, gained from the wolf's battles against the Burning Legion. Perhaps someone in Bloodhoof Village should know of Ghost Howl's demise...."] = "幽靈嚎叫那破爛的皮毛上依舊帶著一道可怕的傷口，那是這頭狼與燃燒軍團作戰時留下的。也許血蹄村裡的人應該知道幽靈嚎叫的死訊……",
    ["He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite. As fortune would have it, while traveling across the plains, I encountered it, and it took a nasty bite from my shoulder."] = "他告訴我它有著惡魔般的紅眼睛、剃刀般鋒利的利爪和有毒的毒牙。也是巧了，我在平原上趕路時遇到了牠，牠在我肩膀上狠狠咬了一口。",
    ["One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."] = "我的一名斥候目睹了來自杜洛塔的商隊遭到襲擊。兇手確實是野豬人剃刀沼澤部落。其中一隻野豬人正帶頭發動襲擊：克雷尼格·斯納爾斯努特。",
    ["While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."] = "雖然我想拿回我所有的貨物，但我知道那是不可能的。不過，有幾樣東西我是絕對必須擁有的！如你所見，我的觀測台已經準備就緒，可是它還需要兩片鏡片中較小的那一片。",
    ["The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."] = "貧瘠之地的草藥和其他地方的不太一樣。它們的特性大體相同，但這裡綠洲的水改變了植物，所以略有不同。",
    ["The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."] = "科卡爾對部落在貧瘠之地的領地構成威脅，我們必須削減他們的兵力。所以，我有一個懸賞任務給你。",
    ["Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."] = "你好。我是守護者伊爾塔萊恩。我在暗影谷的職責是確保自然的平衡得以維持。",
    ["Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."] = "泰達希爾的森林裡正在醞釀著邪惡。沿著山丘望去，那裡曾是和平的熊怪居住的地方。他們已經離開了家園，以夾松部族的名義聚集起來。",
    ["Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."] = "削減暗影谷這裡的幼年生物是個好開始，但仍有工作要做。如果不解決這個問題，森林的資源會消耗得太快。",
    ["The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."] = "惡魔之種是燃燒軍團手中的強大工具。它安放在恐霧峰上的一個洞穴裡，在一座惡魔火焰祭壇之上。我準備了能量石，放在種子附近就能破壞它與軍團的聯繫。",
    ["In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."] = "在湖泊南岸的一個洞穴裡，一個名叫橡怒的小樹人正在向所有以阿拉梅斯湖為家的生物散播腐化。",
    ["Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."] = "現在是拯救利爪德魯伊的時候了。如果現在失敗，他們將永遠沉睡。我會準備喚醒聖物並舉行儀式。",
    ["I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."] = "我與一小隊哨兵被派來這裡保護神諭之樹，防止那些在林間空地四周築巢的鷹身人。",
    ["Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."] = "小樹人正在阿拉梅斯湖水邊萌發。恐怕這些幼苗已經無藥可救——我們應該在它們長大到足以惹出麻煩之前把它們從這片土地上清除。",
    [". A task I would ask of you. Have you seen the ruins of Ameth'Aran? If not, you will find them on the eastern side of the main road, some ways to the south."] = "。我想請你辦一件事。你見過阿梅薩蘭廢墟嗎？如果沒有，它們就在主路東側，往南走一段路就是。",
    ["It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."] = "是最強大的高等精靈之一的手藝造出了囚禁我的封印。在南邊與這裡相似的廢墟阿梅薩蘭，至今仍存在一團藍色的遠古火焰。",
    ["The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war."] = "東邊荊棘刃峽谷的戰豬正在侵入我們部族的狩獵場。牠們是被與我們交戰的刺背野豬人訓練得兇惡的。",
    ["My duties include tending to our wounded warriors, tailoring armor and clothes, and assisting Shadow Priest Sarvis with whatever else he might need."] = "我的職責包括照料我們受傷的戰士，縫製護甲和衣物，以及協助暗影牧師薩維斯處理他需要的其他任何事情。",
    ["Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "通緝：霍格。一頭名叫霍格的巨大豺狼人正在艾爾文森林西南部的林子裡遊蕩。所有捉拿他的嘗試都被他擊潰。暴風城軍隊為這頭豺狼人懸賞了一大筆賞金。",
    ["I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."] = "希望你是來幫我們的。上次穴居人襲擊之後，我們需要一切能得到的幫助。我聽說那些傢伙在各地冒出來，冰冷山谷似乎也不例外。",
    ["After examining this charm, I see now what must be done. Please take it, and do as I ask. You are to explore the deepest areas of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den."] = "檢查過這枚護符後，我現在明白該做什麼了。請拿著它，照我說的做。你要去探索班尼希爾墓穴的最深處。",
    ["Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."] = "現在你必須完成交給你的任務。拿上紡絲器，向伊露恩獻上莎拉絲夫人的祭品，讓那隻巨大的蜘蛛安息。",
    ["Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."] = "有人看到夾松入侵者正在破壞西邊的班尼希爾墓穴。除非我們出手相助，沉睡的德魯伊將永遠被困在翡翠夢境中，對自己的命運一無所知。",
    ["- I have heard of you, newcomer. Perhaps it is you that will help us, where others have failed. We tauren have carved a home out of this land, but not without a cost."] = "——我聽說過你，新來的。也許是你能在別人失敗的地方幫助我們。我們牛頭人在這片土地上開闢了家園，但這並非沒有代價。",
    ["The antidote is ready. Please see that Iverron drinks it. There is something that you should know -- the antidote -- it will only remain viable for 5 minutes."] = "解藥準備好了。請務必讓伊維隆喝下。有件事你應該知道——這解藥只有5分鐘的有效時間。",
    ["You'll find Brother Neals in the abbey, in the bell tower... where he likes to taste his wine."] = "你會在修道院的鐘樓裡找到尼爾斯修士……他喜歡在那裡品嚐他的葡萄酒。",
    ["You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up! We need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment."] = "喂，你！如果你想找點有用的事做，就聽好了！我們需要剛從地裡爬出來的新兵去喪鐘鎮，搜尋任何有用的裝備。",
    ["You may have killed the raptors, but the silver they stole must be recovered! I have reports that the raptors have a large grouping of nests south of Ratchet, known as the Raptor Grounds."] = "你也許殺死了那些迅猛龍，但牠們偷走的銀子必須找回來！我得到報告，說迅猛龍在棘齒城以南有一大片巢穴，叫做迅猛龍平原。",
    ["You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."] = "你是我的一名副官！做好準備。我很快就會召喚你。我在燃刃上花的時間現在幾乎白費了，但這並不意味著暗影議會在別處的計畫就要受損。",
    ["Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."] = "你很可能知道，軍團的許多爪牙會賞賜禮物給他們的追隨者。黑暗女王認為，其中有些禮物由她掌管會比落在那些人手裡更好……",
    ["You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."] = "你在牛頭人的屍體下發現了一個背包。他的雙臂仍緊緊抱著它，彷彿在遭到穴居人攻擊時想要保護它。",
    ["Mellifluous liquid clear as a baby's tears Turns a lovely deep amber over the years But before we proceed to get lit to the hilt A barrel of charred oak must be built."] = "甘醇的液體清澈如嬰兒的淚，歲月流轉化作琥珀深黃。但在我們開懷暢飲之前，必須先造一隻焦橡木桶。",
    ["Return to your own tribe and let them know of your victory here. Show them your trophy, and bask in the glory..."] = "回到你自己的部落，讓他們知道你在這裡的勝利。給他們看你的戰利品，沐浴在榮耀之中……",
    ["When my life was ended upon the rocks, I had no clue what the afterlife held for me. The Lighthouse was black that night because Old Murk-Eye had scared the keeper's family off."] = "當我的生命在岩石上終結時，我不知道來世會給我帶來什麼。那天夜裡燈塔是黑的，因為老瞎眼把守塔人的家人嚇跑了。",
    ["You have proven your loyalty to King Magni. And your hatred for the Dark Iron scum is as great as my own. There is a task I wish to complete myself but I am bound by honor to stay with Longbraid."] = "你已經證明了對麥格尼國王的忠誠。你對黑鐵渣滓的仇恨也和我一樣深。有一件事我想親自去做，但榮譽要求我留在長辮身邊。",
    ["I find myself in quite a pinch here. The bottles are close to running dry. The latest booze shipment is long overdue. The orc invasion has been hell."] = "我發現自己陷入了相當為難的處境。酒瓶快要見底了。最近一批酒早就該到了。獸人入侵簡直是地獄。",
    ["I need some underbelly scales from black dragon whelps to pay for the shoes Argus sent me from Goldshire."] = "我需要黑龍幼崽的腹部鱗片，來支付阿古斯從閃金鎮寄給我的那雙鞋。",
    ["During the last orc invasion we were forced to smelt our iron down to make bullets, swords and armor."] = "上一次獸人入侵時，我們不得不把鐵熔化，用來製造子彈、刀劍和護甲。",
    ["You have uncovered a dark threat to the land. The Resonite cask you have found in that cave houses a slumbering Earthen by the name of Goggeroc."] = "你發現了這片土地上的一個黑暗威脅。你在那個洞穴裡找到的共鳴石桶裡，封印著一個沉睡的土靈，名叫戈格羅克。",
    ["Targorr the Dread served under Gath'Ilzogg as supreme Executioner. His methods were ruthless, even by filthy orc standards. Men who fought bravely to defend the Kingdom were tortured on his whim."] = "恐懼者塔戈爾曾在加斯·伊爾佐格麾下擔任最高劊子手。即使以骯髒的獸人標準來看，他的手段也是殘忍無情的。英勇保衛王國的人們因他一時興起而遭受折磨。",
    ["the gnolls are still out there. I can hear their baying as they hunt in the hills above Lakeshire. And one cry is louder than the rest - Yowler, their leader."] = "豺狼人還在外面。我能聽到牠們在湖畔鎮上方的山丘裡狩獵時的嚎叫。其中有一聲比其他的都響——嚎叫者，牠們的首領。",
    ["our scouts have identified the leader of this recent Trogg incursion. It appears that these beasts in Loch Modan are following the lead of a chieftain named Grawmug."] = "我們的斥候已經查明了這次穴居人入侵的首領。洛克莫丹的這些野獸似乎是在跟隨一個名叫格勞姆格的酋長。",
    ["By order of the Magistrate of Thelsamar: Chok'sul, the ogre presumed to be the leader and coordinator of attacks against the town of Thelsamar, Stonewrought Dam, and the excavation site, is wanted dead through any means necessary."] = "奉塞爾薩瑪行政官之令：食人魔喬克蘇爾被認為是攻擊塞爾薩瑪鎮、石堤水壩和挖掘場的首領和協調者，現通緝其死活，可不擇手段。",
    ["The harlot! The swine! Kenata still lives; her family healthy and prospering while I suffer. Forsaken indeed! My family is gone, taken by the plague."] = "那個婊子！那頭豬！凱娜塔還活著；她的家人健康又興旺，而我卻在受苦。真是被遺忘者！我的家人沒了，被瘟疫奪走了。",
    ["Many of my friends perished that horrible day when the mine tunnel caved in. If your adventures happen to bring you into that wing of the mine in Moonbrook, please keep an eye out for any sign which might identify them."] = "那個可怕的日子，礦坑坍塌時，我的許多朋友都死了。如果你的冒險恰好把你帶到月溪那座礦坑的那一翼，請留意任何能辨認出他們的痕跡。",
    ["Edwin VanCleef must be assassinated. While it saddens me to condemn any man to a death sentence, it is for the greater good of the people of Westfall that VanCleef is laid to rest once and for all."] = "艾德溫·范克里夫必須被刺殺。雖然判任何人死刑都讓我難過，但為了西部荒野人民的更大利益，必須讓范克里夫徹底安息。",
    ["Travel to his cottage just north of town, and execute Stalvan, once and for all. When the deed is done, travel to Madame Eva's and show her his family ring."] = "前往鎮子北邊的他的小屋，處決史塔爾文，一了百了。事成之後，前往伊娃夫人那裡，把他的家族戒指給她看。",
    ["It's no secret that the trademark of the Defias Gang is their Red Bandanas. But we've learned that the material from which these bandanas are made signifies the member's rank."] = "迪菲亞兄弟會的標誌是他們的紅色頭巾，這早已不是祕密。但我們已經發現，製作這些頭巾的材料代表著成員的等級。",
    ["I, the great Bartolo, shall make for you the world famous, Alliance renowned, Yeti Fur Cloak!"] = "我，偉大的巴托洛，將為你製作舉世聞名、在聯盟中享有盛譽的雪人毛皮斗篷！",
    ["You got here just in the nick of time! The Pyrewood Council will be returning any moment. Arugal has other matters to tend to in the keep. He uses the Council as mere puppets to keep the mindless minions of Pyrewood under his control."] = "你來得正是時候！火林議會隨時都會回來。阿魯高在城堡裡還有其他事要處理。他把議會當作傀儡，來控制火林那些沒有頭腦的爪牙。",
    ["Here you go. Bring this message to Master Carevin. A few more like you, and we will outnumber the Night Watch! Perhaps then we could complete the work that we few carry on today."] = "給你。把這封信帶給卡雷文大師。再有幾個像你這樣的人，我們的人數就要超過守夜人了！也許那時我們就能完成我們這少數幾個人今天仍在繼續的工作。",
    ["The keg fizzles slightly."] = "酒桶微微地冒著泡。",
    ["Just before the invasion I uncovered a large tablet called the Goaz Stone. The translated text breaks off in 4 places. The text speaks of a \"divine plan\" and a \"doomed prophecy.\" I fear we are running out of time."] = "就在入侵之前，我發現了一塊名叫戈阿茲石的大石板。翻譯出的文字有4處中斷。文字談到了一個「神聖的計畫」和一個「注定的預言」。我擔心我們的時間不多了。",
    ["I have prepared a report for the King. I believe you should be the one to deliver it to him, along with an account of your findings. Do not worry, there is no doubt that he will commend you for doing your duty to the people of Stormwind."] = "我為國王準備了一份報告。我認為應該由你把它交給他，並附上你的發現記述。不用擔心，他一定會為你對暴風城人民盡到的職責而嘉獎你。",
    ["I can't lift the curse from the Eye of Paleth."] = "我無法解除帕雷斯之眼上的詛咒。",
    ["After pulling the barrel free from the muck and opening it, a silvery figurine is found packed in fine straw. It depicts a young, long-haired Paladin with hammer upraised."] = "把桶從爛泥裡拉出來並打開後，你發現一尊銀色的小雕像，用細稻草包著。它描繪的是一位年輕的長髮聖騎士，高舉著錘子。",
    ["Morbent Fel hides in his lair, the house perched atop the hill to the east overlooking the Raven Hill cemetery. His time in this land is drawing to an end..."] = "莫爾本特·費爾藏在他的巢穴裡，那是東邊山頂上俯瞰烏鴉嶺墓地的那座房子。他在這片土地上的日子快要到頭了……",
    ["We have a real infestation problem to the west. Tunnel rat kobolds have moved into the foothills, setting up dens and fouling our land with their filth!"] = "我們西邊出現了嚴重的蟲害。隧道鼠狗頭人搬進了山麓，建造巢穴，用牠們的污穢玷污我們的土地！",
    ["Ready to go? First, we need to get this powder to Ironband. It'll be a lot for me to carry, and these parts can get dangerous -- and who knows what else the Dark Irons might have in store for me."] = "準備好出發了嗎？首先，我們得把這批火藥送到鐵帶那裡。我一個人搬會很吃力，而這一帶可能很危險——天知道黑鐵矮人還給我準備了什麼。",
    ["Valdred, once my good friend, was my wife's murderer. Although I am incapable of grieving, I do yearn for revenge. If you kill Valdred and bring me his cursed hands, then I will reward you."] = "瓦爾德雷德曾是我的好朋友，卻是殺害我妻子的兇手。雖然我已無法悲傷，但我渴望復仇。如果你殺了瓦爾德雷德，把他那雙被詛咒的手帶來給我，我就會獎勵你。",
    ["In preparation for an assault on Shadowfang, two deathstalkers were sent to the keep to gather intelligence."] = "為了準備進攻影牙城堡，兩名死亡獵手被派往城堡收集情報。",
    ["Sure enough, deep within the Old Jug there is another clue to Sander's treasure."] = "果然，在舊酒壺的深處還有另一條通往桑德寶藏的線索。",
    ["At last, friends of the Alliance! Help... please... The last thing I remember these foul Orcs overpowered our regiment. Most the men were killed."] = "終於，聯盟的朋友！幫幫我……求你……我記得的最後一件事，是這些骯髒的獸人擊潰了我們的團。大部分人都被殺了。",
    ["An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."] = "一位強大的大法師正在監督魔力節點的重新啟動。以他們目前的進展，我們阻止他們的唯一希望就是殺死他。",
    ["Thule once told me that, long ago, he and two colleagues created a magic wand, woven together from the apprentice wands each mage possessed."] = "圖爾曾告訴我，很久以前，他和兩位同事用每位法師各自擁有的學徒法杖編織在一起，製成了一根魔杖。",
    ["Now is the time to assault the Scourge's place of strength in Silverpine: Fenris Isle. You must again go to the Isle and destroy Thule Ravenclaw."] = "現在是攻擊天譴軍團在銀松森林的力量據點的時候了：芬里斯島。你必須再次前往那座島，消滅圖爾·鴉爪。",
    ["The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."] = "迪菲亞戰線在不斷變動。我已經跟蹤他們的行動相當長一段時間了。順便說一句，我已經確認，幫派中的許多成員可以透過他們佩戴的紅色皮革頭巾來追蹤。",
    ["The Embalmer is a name told in one of our children's stories. He was a kindly alchemist, driven mad by the death of his wife, Eliza. To restore her, he used dark magic to place his own heart within the bosom of his dead spouse."] = "防腐者是我們孩子們的故事裡的一個名字。他曾是一位善良的鍊金術士，因妻子伊莉莎之死而發瘋。為了讓她復活，他用黑暗魔法把自己的心臟放進了亡妻的胸膛裡。",
    ["I sent my apprentice out into the marshes to skin some of our famous giant Wetlands crocolisks. When he didn't return, I went out to look for him..."] = "我派學徒去沼澤裡剝一些我們著名的濕地巨型鱷魚的皮。他沒有回來，我就出去找他……",
    ["While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."] = "你在下面的時候，我碰巧注意到其中一頭野獸比其他的更突出。牠更大，更兇惡。我敢打賭，就是牠帶著其他的來到這裡，擾亂了挖掘場。",
    ["My brother Quinn and I were tasked to recon Silverpine Forest and report to High Executor Hadrec. But we didn't get far -- when moving through this farm we were attacked by the ghoul Ivar the Foul."] = "我哥哥奎因和我奉命偵察銀松森林，並向高階執行者哈德雷克報告。但我們沒走多遠——穿過這座農場時，我們遭到了食屍鬼「污穢者」艾瓦爾的襲擊。",
    ["Dangerous! The following humans of Hillsbrad have been deemed dangerous and are marked for bounty by High Executor Darthalia: Clerk Horrace Whitesteed."] = "危險！希爾斯布萊德的以下人類已被認定為危險人物，並由高階執行者達爾薩莉亞懸賞通緝：文書霍拉斯·白馬。",
    ["I hear you were enlisted by Darthalia to wage war on the humans of Hillsbrad. So jealous I am..."] = "我聽說你被達爾薩莉亞徵召去對希爾斯布萊德的人類發動戰爭。我真是羨慕啊……",
    ["Oh...the flowers are blooming in Hillsbrad and the air is so fresh and brisk. I can't help but to wallow in the misery of it all. I look out my grimy window and long for the day when our New Plague brings this world the death it deserves."] = "哦……希爾斯布萊德的花兒開了，空氣是那麼清新爽朗。我忍不住沉溺在這一切的悲慘之中。我望著骯髒的窗外，渴望著我們的新瘟疫給這個世界帶來它應得的死亡的那一天。",
    ["A mudsnout composite? Absolutely brilliant! Why didn't I think of that? Let me contribute my colloid of decay to this devilish brew."] = "泥鼻合成物？絕妙！我怎麼沒想到呢？讓我把我的腐敗膠體也加進這副惡魔般的混合物裡。",
    ["High Executor Darthalia sent me to keep watch of Dun Garok from a distance. I had set up camp just out of sight. But when morning came and I had to boil water, I left to gather firewood."] = "高階執行者達爾薩莉亞派我遠遠地監視敦加洛克。我在不遠處紮了營。可是早晨到了，我要燒水，就離開去撿柴火。",
    ["Ain't nothin' that irks me more than losin' these here beautiful horses."] = "沒有什麼比失去這些漂亮的馬更讓我惱火了。",
    ["I am the new magistrate of Southshore, recently assigned after the assassination of the previous magistrate."] = "我是南海鎮的新任行政官，是在前任行政官遇刺後不久任命的。",
    ["Take this sealed commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把這封封好的嘉獎信帶給幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯。",
    ["Here is the final challenge that I will put forth. We've been tracking an elusive tiger for weeks."] = "這是我要提出的最後一個挑戰。我們已經追蹤一隻難以捉摸的老虎好幾個星期了。",
    ["You've almost proven yourself to be a master hunter of panthers."] = "你幾乎已經證明了自己是獵豹的大師級獵人。",
    ["For this, I use only the best elder croc skins. They are more durable and a better canvas--if you will--for adding the designs and accents that make Drizzlik's Excelsior line."] = "為此，我只用最好的老鱷魚皮。牠們更耐用，也是更好的畫布——如果你願意這麼說——可以添加構成德里茲利克卓越系列的圖案和點綴。",
    ["There is but one final reagent needed to complete the enchantment. In the south, towards the western coast, high above the bluffs, lies a Holy Spring."] = "完成附魔只差最後一樣材料。在南邊，靠近西海岸，在懸崖高處，有一處聖泉。",
    ["Avast! Who goes there? Argh, I am but useless without me special enchanted eye. Bad enough to have lost me eyes in battle in the first place!"] = "喂！誰在那兒？啊，沒有我那隻特別的魔法眼睛，我就一無是處。當初在戰鬥中失去眼睛已經夠糟了！",
    ["Because you proved yourself to be such a go-getter in the jungle, let me tell you about a ferocious raptor that even I have failed to kill."] = "既然你在叢林裡表現得如此積極，讓我告訴你一頭兇猛的迅猛龍，就連我也沒能殺死牠。",
    ["So you're looking for an altar of some sort? Well, I'm no expert on troll ruins like my father, but I have heard about a sunken troll city out near that island you're looking for."] = "這麼說你在找某種祭壇？嗯，我不像我父親那樣精通食人妖遺跡，不過我聽說在你要找的那座島附近有一座沉沒的食人妖城市。",
    ["Although no mention of Private Thorsen is found in these records, hidden within the binding of one of Herod's ledger books is a small, brass key."] = "雖然這些記錄裡沒有提到索森二等兵，但在希律的一本帳簿的封皮夾層裡藏著一把小黃銅鑰匙。",
    ["While you were gone I fixed the pot you brought me. I even added an extra steam whistle, and look! There's a new chopper at the bottom that'll cut through leg bones!"] = "你不在的時候我修好了你帶給我的鍋。我甚至多加了一個蒸汽哨子，看！底部還有一把新的砍刀，能砍斷腿骨！",
    ["Kurzen may be dead, but...that which drove him to evil still lives! Through my studies I have discovered this: An Ogre Mage - Mai'Zoth - dwells in an Ogre Mound within the eastern mountains of Stranglethorn."] = "庫爾森也許死了，但是……驅使他作惡的東西還活著！經過我的研究，我發現了這個：一名食人魔法師——麥佐斯——住在荊棘谷東部山區的一座食人魔土丘裡。",
    ["The Venture Company has a string of operations through Stranglethorn which keeps hard-working goblins, like me, from making honest gold! Please, you must help me!"] = "風險投資公司在荊棘谷各地經營著一系列產業，讓像我這樣辛勤工作的地精無法賺到老實錢！求求你，你一定要幫我！",
    ["Negolash is a hungry giant. When the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants."] = "內戈拉什是個飢餓的巨人。巨人們摧毀我們的船時，內戈拉什徑直衝向我的廚房。他不像其他巨人那樣渴求船員。",
    ["Zanzil the Outcast dwells with his followers in the Jubuwal and Aboraz Ruins, northeast of Booty Bay. He is exiled from his tribe. Why? Well..."] = "被放逐者贊吉爾和他的追隨者住在藏寶海灣東北面的朱布瓦爾和阿博拉茲廢墟。他被自己的部落放逐了。為什麼？嗯……",
    ["We must find if Yenniku is dead. Slay the Bloodscalp Headhunters and take from them their Shrunken Heads. You must gather many, many heads, and I will inspect them to make sure Yenniku's head is not among them."] = "我們必須弄清耶尼庫是否已死。殺死血頂獵頭者，從他們身上取得縮小的頭顱。你必須收集很多很多顆頭顱，我會檢查，確保裡面沒有耶尼庫的頭。",
    ["I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."] = "我已將心靈之眼重塑成了靈魂寶石。它有雙重用途：你必須用它來擊昏耶尼庫，擊昏後把它放在他頭上，困住他的靈魂。",
    ["I was sent to Grom'gol to aid Nimboya on his quest, but... I too have reasons for being here. The Bloodscalp tribe is enemy to our tribe. Collecting trophies of our enemies gives us power over them."] = "我被派往格羅姆高協助尼姆博亞完成任務，但是……我來這裡也有自己的原因。血頂部落是我們部落的敵人。收集敵人的戰利品，能讓我們對他們擁有力量。",
    ["Now that you have gathered Bloodscalp trophies, I have another task for you. The Skullsplitter tribe of trolls live to the southeast, and for years we have warred with them."] = "既然你已經收集了血頂部落的戰利品，我還有另一項任務交給你。碎顱者食人妖部落住在東南面，多年來我們一直和他們交戰。",
    ["Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"] = "多倫中尉是不是想讓你把巡邏情報向他回報？",
    ["To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."] = "想要對抗庫爾森，我們就得讓他的治療支援失效。他召集了大批巫醫，用叢林藥劑治療他的部隊，並用毒蕨萃取物毒害我們的戰士。",
    ["Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."] = "可憐的赫拉拉斯！還有這位矮人……獨眉。他是多麼勇敢的靈魂。我們決不能讓他們的英勇白白浪費。這個老太婆……查爾加·剃刀沼澤……",
    ["All that remains is to deliver the Crown of Will to Sharlindra in the Undercity. She will see that it is delivered to Lady Sylvanas."] = "剩下的就是把意志之冠送到幽暗城的莎琳德拉那裡。她會負責把它交給希瓦娜斯女士。",
    ["Heavens no! Poor Rustlocke. 'Tis quite a tragedy indeed. We must not let his death pass in vain."] = "天哪，不！可憐的拉斯洛克。這真是一場悲劇。我們決不能讓他的死變得毫無意義。",
    ["Argh, 'tis a horrible life. I should be in a watery grave right now, not sittin' here by the fire, breathin' fresh air. The crew tried so hard to save my beautiful Maiden's Folly."] = "唉，這日子真是糟透了。我現在本該躺在水底的墳墓裡，而不是坐在這裡烤著火、呼吸著新鮮空氣。船員們拚命想救我那艘美麗的「少女之愚」號。",
    ["Such a shame the land is in such shambles. But the Memorial came out quite well!"] = "這片土地竟然如此破敗，真是可惜。不過紀念碑倒是建得相當不錯！",
    ["There is no doubt in my mind that a powerful warlock resides within the walls of Stromgarde. From time to time, using an arcane magical relic, this warlock has summoned forth terrible demons in large numbers."] = "我毫不懷疑，在斯通納德的城牆內住著一名強大的術士。這名術士不時利用一件奧術魔法聖物，召喚出大批可怕的惡魔。",
    ["This is bad. It seems the Daggerspines are amassing for an attack. Naga are known for their ruthlessness in battle. They will keep attacking until I am dead."] = "情況不妙。看來匕首嶺一族正在集結準備進攻。納迦在戰鬥中的無情是出了名的。他們會一直攻擊，直到我死去。",
    ["Even though my will is free, I can serve the Dark Lady no more. I feel my time on Azeroth has come to an end. My life force is shattered. Interrogator Vishas did this to me!"] = "雖然我的意志是自由的，但我再也無法侍奉黑暗女王了。我感到我在艾澤拉斯的時間已經走到盡頭。我的生命力已經破碎。這都是審問者維沙斯幹的！",
    ["You must defeat Myzrael before she grows in strength. If you do not, then once she has gathered enough power she will challenge her captors!"] = "你必須在邁茲蕾爾變強之前打敗她。否則，一旦她積聚了足夠的力量，她就會向囚禁她的人發起挑戰！",
    ["A bounty has been placed on the head of Marez Cowl, a high-level advisor and operative of the Syndicate. She was last seen within the Syndicate controlled territory of Stromgarde."] = "辛迪加的高級顧問兼特工馬雷茲·考爾的頭顱已被懸賞。她最後一次被人看到是在辛迪加控制的斯通納德領地內。",
    ["Oh my! Oh my! There is a doom approaching. Mark me! A doom! No, I cannot speak of it...cannot utter their names or they may hear me! But if we learn, yes, if we learn more of them...then maybe we can learn how to foil them!"] = "哦天哪！哦天哪！有一場厄運正在逼近。記住我的話！一場厄運！不，我不能說……不能說出他們的名字，否則他們可能會聽到我！但如果我們瞭解，對，如果我們瞭解更多關於他們的事……也許我們就能知道如何挫敗他們！",
    ["Maybe it'll even help protect you from the coming atrocity that is Lotwil's newest invention. I've been working with all the extra stones you collected for him, and I can make some nice bracers that you might want to use."] = "也許它甚至能幫你抵禦即將到來的暴行，也就是洛特維爾的最新發明。我一直在用你為他收集的所有多餘石頭做東西，我能做一副不錯的護腕，你也許用得上。",
    ["The last report I received from Agmond is troubling, more so now that he's dead! He mentioned that his diggers uncovered \"ancient urns\" at the dig site outside Uldaman."] = "我從阿格蒙德那裡收到的最後一份報告令人不安，現在他死了就更令人擔憂！他提到他的挖掘工人在奧達曼外的挖掘場發現了「古代的甕」。",
    ["Agmond's tracks lead from the west. It is easy to tell from the bloody smears across rock and sand that the dwarf crawled some distance."] = "阿格蒙德的足跡從西邊延伸過來。從岩石和沙地上的血跡很容易看出，那個矮人爬行了相當長一段距離。",
    ["I have the digest for you. I need not tell you to take great care with it. And to keep it far from unfriendly hands. This book holds many truths......And the truth can burn."] = "我為你準備了一份摘要。不用我說你也該知道要小心保管，並且讓它遠離不友善的人。這本書裡有許多真相……而真相是會灼人的。",
    ["After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."] = "經過長期觀察，我發現了摩根斯的計畫。他在尋找伊露恩之鐮……而且他可能已經找到了！如果是這樣，赤脊山和暴風城王國很快就會感受到他的黑暗力量。",
    ["You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."] = "你對付那些副官和嘍囉幹得太出色了，所以我想請你為我做最後一件事。瑟蕾娜·血羽是一隻名叫血羽的鷹身人的姐妹，那隻鷹身人很久以前被雷克薩殺死了。",
    ["The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."] = "雷鷹是一種兇猛的野獸。是時候讓你去面對牠們了。你必須找到牠出沒的地方，把牠的翅膀帶給我，作為你狩獵成功的證明。",
    ["Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."] = "我艦隊的又一艘船被北郡要塞那些過度熱心的人類擊沉了！必須收拾那些混蛋。他們的偏執已使他們陷入瘋狂。",
    ["Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."] = "終於！有人來救我了！真不敢相信你竟然越過了守衛。這些來自塞拉摩的狂熱分子簡直瘋了。他們擊沉了我們的船，還把我這個唯一的倖存者關了起來。",
    ["Following Khazgorm's plans it should be no problem to fashion an explosive charge Ah, there we go. Now, I am going to entrust you with a special task."] = "按照卡茲戈姆的計畫，製作一個爆破炸藥應該沒問題。啊，好了。現在我要託付你一項特殊的任務。",
    ["Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."] = "也許你瞭解不確定的痛苦，也許不瞭解。但要知道：我每天站在這裡，從日出到日落，搜尋地平線上是否還有那些怪物。",
    ["Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."] = "注意！懸賞擊殺魚人「莫克迪普」。",
    ["Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."] = "把洛克的頭帶給十字路口的索克。他不用任何言語就該知道我的部落發生了什麼……哈，不過他可不會相信曼格爾圖斯幫過這種忙。",
    ["The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons."] = "據我所知，南邊巨人之原那邊的剃刀沼澤野豬人沒有熟練的鐵匠，但他們顯然已經開始製造更堅固的武器了。",
    ["Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."] = "拉開控制台的面板，裡面是一團密密麻麻的電線、管道和其他奇怪的機械裝置——其中大部分似乎沒有任何實際用途。",
    ["I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"] = "我想邊走邊學吧……應該不會太難。就是這裡幾個按鈕，一兩個拉桿……好了，你準備好出發了嗎？",
    ["I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."] = "我已經把你給我的孢子製成了乳劑。現在我必須把它送給我的同事，藥劑師札瑪。如果你把它帶給她，她會從我們的鍊金物品庫存裡給你一些東西。",
    ["The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"] = "貧瘠之地的迅猛龍比其他地方的迅猛龍更聰明。我覺得所有的智慧都藏在牠們的角裡！",
    ["Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."] = "赫茲魯·血痕是貧瘠之地科卡爾半人馬的首領。他兇猛、殘暴又狡猾。打敗他會瓦解並分裂科卡爾，大大降低他們對我們的威脅。",
    ["The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."] = "偉大的伊莎·阿瓦克是這片水域的主人。他力量強大，自尊莊嚴。海岸上的人類懼怕他，因為他吞食了許多他們的人。",
    ["All right, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there."] = "好吧，那就硬闖。你準備好後我們就離開這裡。我們一路殺到大路上——格里姆克勞應該還在那裡。",
    ["I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."] = "我正在調製一種藥水，需要稀有的蘑菇，這種蘑菇只生長在某個洞穴裡。那個洞穴在崖泉瀑布後面，沿著山脈往東稍微偏北。",
    ["In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."] = "在永恆之井的戰鬥之後，我聽說阿梅薩蘭被毀了，那裡的人民都死了，包括我的愛人阿娜雅。",
    ["Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."] = "伊爾克魯德·瑪格斯魯。是的，我知道他。他是個強大的獸人術士，住在火痕神殿，那是梣谷西南部一個極其邪惡的地方。",
    ["When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."] = "當我發現雷魯之石時，我以為它是解開化石之謎的鑰匙。我在路上去見維爾加時，遭到迅猛龍攻擊，聖物也丟了。",
    ["So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."] = "所以勘探者想把那塊神祕的化石送到達納蘇斯的探險者協會？沒有他，我離開黑海岸心裡不踏實。",
    ["The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"] = "你在大師之刃那裡找到的羊皮紙是一部古代文獻的一頁……是精靈寫的！",
    ["I fear the ancient statuette's secrets will remain forever hidden unless you find the key to its ancient lock. That key is a ring, the Ring of Zoram."] = "恐怕除非你找到開啟它古老鎖具的鑰匙，這尊古代小雕像的祕密將永遠被埋沒。那把鑰匙是一枚戒指，佐拉姆之戒。",
    ["Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."] = "蕾拉拉的高燒已經退了，但她仍然非常虛弱。我不認為光靠時間就能讓她恢復失去的力量。我想需要月亮石的力量。",
    ["Anilia puts her hands on your shoulders and draws you close. Gasping, she points towards the arch to the north, before her eyes close and her last wheezing breath leaves her body."] = "阿妮莉亞把手搭在你的肩上，把你拉近。她喘息著指向北邊的拱門，隨後雙眼闔上，最後一口喘息從她體內離去。",
    ["Blackrock Outrunners and Renegades are running ambushes between here and Stonewatch Keep. The leader of the Outrunners is an orc named Tharil'zun--we want this orc."] = "黑石疾行者和叛徒們正在這裡和石望要塞之間設伏。疾行者的首領是一個名叫塔里爾祖恩的獸人——我們要這個獸人。",
    ["Now that I've finished copying the book, here's the original Stresses of Iron. Thank you for your patience, and if you see Milton please tell him I'm sorry for the long delay."] = "既然我已經抄完了這本書，這是原版的《鋼鐵的壓力》。謝謝你的耐心，如果你見到米爾頓，請告訴他我為拖了這麼久而抱歉。",
    ["Because you fought with such valor and perseverance in the Battle of Hillsbrad, I have written this commendation, extolling your heroics in combat for the high command to recognize."] = "由於你在希爾斯布萊德之戰中表現出的勇氣和毅力，我寫了這份嘉獎信，頌揚你在戰鬥中的英勇事蹟，好讓最高指揮部看到。",
    ["Archmage Arugal called the worgen to Silverpine to defend against the Scourge, lost control of them immediately, and went mad in Shadowfang Keep among the things he had summoned."] = "大法師阿魯高把狼人召喚到銀松森林來抵禦天譴軍團，卻立即失去了對牠們的控制，並在影牙城堡裡與他召喚出的東西為伴，發了瘋。",
    ["Shadowfang Keep holds a book, the Book of Ur, which would be much prized in my collection. Ur was a great mage of Dalaran before the coming of the Scourge, his studies in other worlds are of much value to..."] = "影牙城堡裡有一本書，烏爾之書，我的收藏裡若有它會很珍貴。烏爾是天譴軍團到來之前達拉然的一位偉大法師，他對其他世界的研究極有價值……",
    ["Arugal's own belt. He summoned the worgen to save Silverpine, then lost his mind in Shadowfang Keep surrounded by what he had called."] = "阿魯高自己的腰帶。他召喚狼人來拯救銀松森林，然後在影牙城堡裡被自己召喚出的東西包圍，失去了理智。",
    ["Arugal still resides in Shadowfang Keep. We cannot claim Silverpine as a strategic stronghold for the Dark Lady until Arugal is slain. I shall see to it that his magic is eradicated."] = "阿魯高仍然住在影牙城堡。在阿魯高被殺之前，我們不能宣稱銀松森林是黑暗女王的戰略據點。我會確保他的魔法被根除。",
    ["These deviate creatures have strange, otherworldly properties."] = "這些畸變的生物擁有奇異的、不屬於這個世界的特性。",
    ["Hey. I been sent to the Crossroads to watch over the land and take note of its happenings for my masters in Orgrimmar. One object of my studies are the insect-like creatures found to the south in the Field of Giants."] = "嘿。我被派到十字路口監視這片土地，並為我在奧格瑪的主人們記錄這裡發生的事。我的研究對象之一，是南邊巨人之原上發現的類似昆蟲的生物。",
    ["The druids in the Wailing Caverns, the Druids of the Fang, are an aberration. They were part of an order of noble druids whose plan was to heal the Barrens, but now seek to remake that land to match their own, twisted dreams."] = "哀嚎洞穴裡的德魯伊，也就是尖牙德魯伊，是一種異類。他們曾是一個高貴德魯伊教團的成員，計畫治癒貧瘠之地，但現在卻想按照他們自己扭曲的夢想重塑那片土地。",
    ["All right then... if you're sure, we'll sneak out of here. Let us leave when you're ready. Remember, after you've escaped, meet Terenthis back in Auberdine."] = "好吧……如果你確定的話，我們就偷偷溜出去。等你準備好我們就離開。記住，逃出去之後，到奧伯丁去見泰倫希斯。",
    ["So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."] = "我太興奮了！三個小籠子關三個小精靈！可是我們該拿我們可愛的擁抱樹木的朋友怎麼辦呢？嗯，讓我們讓他們嚐嚐……",
    ["I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."] = "我見過格倫佐一次，不過我告訴你，他可不好看。他的肉看起來像是在腐爛，他把金屬和齒輪嫁接到身上，用機械替換了一些肢體。",
    ["The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."] = "德魯伊在石爪峰上建造了利爪巢穴，在那裡保管著許多強大的物品。他們設計了一個複雜的計畫，防止這些物品落入壞人手中。",
    ["I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "我相信泰蘭德·語風本人也會想感謝你參與這次任務。表面上看也許不明顯，但你幫忙開啟的事，很可能會鞏固我們在石爪山脈的立足點。",
    ["As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."] = "你也許知道，飛龍常被獸人馴服來當坐騎。但鮮為人知的是，飛龍的毒液在某些圈子裡比這頭野獸本身更有價值。",
    ["it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."] = "現在是你前往遙遠土地的時候了。你已經準備好了。你現在要獵殺霜喉，一頭位於奧特蘭克山脈的雪人。他行蹤難覓，白色的毛皮與他山間家園的積雪融為一體。",
    ["There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."] = "好了，我已經按拉澤瑞克的要求做完了。只要告訴他，引爆這東西的時候要小心。只要他稍有差池，他就不會前進，只會變成軌道上的一塊焦痕。",
    ["Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."] = "銅錠具有驚人的耐熱性！我確信它能用在菲茲爾的活塞上。不過他需要真正的銅錠礦石，而不只是碎屑。",
    ["Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."] = "用你帶來的水，你就能暫時澆滅守著半人馬聖物的火焰。不過它不是永久的，所以你必須動作快。",
    ["As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."] = "你也許知道，我收集傳說。古老的傳說。強大的傳說。能開啟門戶的傳說，還有能喚醒沉睡者的傳說。",
    ["The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."] = "戰鬥進展順利。如果我們繼續在對抗惡魔及其爪牙的戰鬥中取得如此巨大的進展，也許酋長會允許我們在季節更替之前回家。",
    ["At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."] = "終於，救援來了！你根本不知道我被關在這裡多久了。我已經不記得上次看到這裡外面是什麼時候了。",
    ["I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."] = "我活不了多久了……所以……所以……虛弱……勇敢的矮人，獨眉，被派去警、警告法芬德爾……但在我……死、死之前……我的妻子，特蕾莎拉……",
    ["you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."] = "你幫助我們對抗了瑪格拉姆。現在，幫助我們擊敗瑪拉頓！殺死他們部落的首領，哈瑞斯汗！要面對他，吹響瑪拉頓戰爭號角。",
    ["Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."] = "既然你嚇住了半人馬部落，現在是讓他們流血的時候了。在淒涼之地旅行時，獵殺半人馬。我不在乎你獵殺哪個部落。只管收集耳朵。",
    ["The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."] = "蓋爾基斯汗死了，現在瑪拉頓也要倒下了！殺死瑪拉頓汗，哈瑞斯！要面對他，吹響長矛谷高處懸崖上的號角。",
    ["Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."] = "把卡尼托爾的東西帶回鐵爐堡的羅伊頓那裡，他會為你出色完成任務付錢。哈哈，你要是不小心，他會滿意得請你全職加入我們。",
    ["To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."] = "要拿到報酬，你得回到鐵爐堡，親自跟羅伊頓談。反正他會很樂意把萊夫特維奇的包裹處理掉。",
    ["Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."] = "瑟拉基斯是納迦在黑暗深淵被淹沒的大廳裡飼養的巨型水獸，也是下層神殿完全沉沒在水下的原因。",
    ["Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."] = "加摩拉是納迦在黑暗深淵裡飼養的遠古巨龜，年代久遠到那裡的暮光教徒把牠視作神殿的一部分。",
    ["Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."] = "暮光之錘的成員因混亂的上古之神的古老儀式而獲得力量，努力讓他們黑暗的主人歸來，並在世界各地散播死亡與恐懼。",
    ["Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."] = "愚蠢的血精靈在擺弄惡魔魔法。他們沒見過卡林多的納迦和薩特發生了什麼嗎？我擔心血精靈也會遭遇類似的畸變。",
    ["Now there is just one more item needed to complete this device. Cog's blueprint calls for a lens of some sort. The only lens I know of that would be large enough will be very difficult to acquire."] = "現在完成這個裝置只差一件東西。寇格的藍圖需要某種鏡片。我所知道的唯一足夠大的鏡片，會非常難以取得。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade's chief scholar, who guards the Monastery library and its collection rather more aggressively than a librarian should."] = "血色十字軍的首席學者，守衛修道院圖書館及其藏書的方式，比圖書管理員應有的要兇狠得多。",
    ["The survival of our people and lands comes at unfortunate costs. You have spilled the blood of nature's servants; many sick animals you have felled."] = "我們的人民和土地的存續是以不幸的代價換來的。你已經灑下了自然僕從的鮮血；你殺死了許多生病的動物。",
    ["The future is inevitable! We hurl ourselves towards it like falling raindrops to the Great Sea. But perhaps, by studying the past, we can know what to expect and be better prepared for the unknown."] = "未來是不可避免的！我們朝它投去，就像雨滴落入大海。但也許透過研究過去，我們能知道會發生什麼，並為未知做好更充分的準備。",
    ["The Earthen Ring had pure intentions towards our plagued brethren. But who is to know the motivations of those whispering in the ears of the Elder Council?"] = "大地之環對我們受瘟疫侵襲的兄弟們懷有純粹的意圖。但誰能知道那些在長老議會耳邊低語的人的動機呢？",
    ["Revelosh was a Shadowforge explorer who went into Uldaman looking for the origin of the dwarves, and became part of the ruin instead."] = "雷弗洛什是影爐的探險者，他進入奧達曼尋找矮人的起源，結果卻成了廢墟的一部分。",
    ["A Gnomeregan oddity whose Use effect grants a huge burst of attack speed. Feral druids kept it for that alone, because it works in cat form -- and it has limited charges, so every use is a decision."] = "一件諾姆瑞根的奇物，其使用效果能帶來巨大的攻擊速度爆發。野性德魯伊就只為這一點留著它，因為它在獵豹形態下也能用——而且次數有限，所以每一次使用都是一個抉擇。",
    ["Mud big ogre. Me hungry. Go bash fishy. Bring Mud food. You feed Mud or Mud eat you."] = "泥巴大食人魔。我餓。去揍魚。給泥巴帶吃的。你餵泥巴，不然泥巴吃你。",
    ["The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."] = "野獸的頭已經可以砍下來了……要用很大的力量。你已經展現出一切跡象，表明你能幫我們完成這最後的有力一擊。",
    ["Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it."] = "很久以前，我擁有一件美麗的珠寶，深淵之冠。它不僅漂亮——對那些懂得使用的人來說，它還擁有強大的力量。",
    ["Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"] = "布萊中士偷了我的東西！他說他只是借用一下，可他偷走了我心愛的神聖探測杖！！沒有那根杖，我怎麼知道該在哪裡挖新水井？？",
    ["Wha.. What happened? The last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs."] = "什……什麼情況？我記得的最後一件事是被一群黑鐵矮人抓住，被打得只剩一口氣，然後和這些骯髒的穴居人一起被扔到這裡。",
    ["Listen, that ring is yours, sure..."] = "聽著，那枚戒指是你的，當然……",
    ["No, no, no - I'm not all of the sudden saying that the ring is mine."] = "不，不，不——我並不是突然說這枚戒指是我的。",
    ["When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."] = "我們逃離諾姆瑞根的時候，留下了太多資料！至關重要的資料！我需要稜彩打孔卡上的資料，它來自諾姆瑞根深處一台高度安全的終端，矩陣打孔機3005-D。",
    ["It's terrible. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh. What we need are spare parts."] = "太糟糕了。我們的迴轉鑽探挖掘機艦隊沒有足夠的零件運到丹莫洛。我們需要的是備用零件。",
    ["I have cutting to do. I can't tell you what I'm going to cut, but... I need myself a blade. A certain blade... Some people call it a sword. I call it a swing blade."] = "我有東西要切。我不能告訴你我要切什麼，但是……我需要一把刀刃。一把特定的刀刃……有人管它叫劍。我管它叫揮舞刀刃。",
    ["Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."] = "地精科技——兩年前它最常見的用途是當笑料。時代確實變了。現在他們造出了一套新裝置，比我們所有的伐木機型號加起來都強。",
    ["My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"] = "我對製皮的理念是，作品必須是最高品質——絕不妥協。任何說品質不重要的人，都是想把丹莫洛的海景地產賣給你！",
    ["I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"] = "我為我的製皮手藝感到自豪，我覺得這一點看得出來；品質絕不應妥協。任何說品質不重要的人，也會讓你相信大地不保守祕密！",
    ["\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."] = "「給你，能源已安全取出，資料也保存下來了。好了，一路平安之類的。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-17/TN to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "地精的聲音又從機器人裡劈啪作響地傳出：「我需要把OOX-17/TN移到一個開闊安全的地方，這樣它才能開始漫長的起飛程序。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "地精的聲音又從機器人裡劈啪作響地傳出：「我需要把OOX-22/FE移到一個開闊安全的地方，這樣它才能開始漫長的起飛程序。",
    ["We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"] = "我們必須救出銳喙！殺上位於邪枝領地中心的金薩阿羅之巔，從邪惡的女祭司赫克絲手中取得銳喙籠子的鑰匙，然後找到並救出銳喙！",
    ["Do you think you could help me find my way back to my friend, Rockbiter? He was supposed to be watching me... But I do have a tendency to wander off now and then."] = "你覺得你能幫我找到回到我朋友石咬那裡的路嗎？他本來應該看著我的……不過我確實有時會到處亂跑的傾向。",
    ["I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"] = "我剛到菲拉斯，聽說住在這片荒野裡的戈杜尼食人魔擁有一些有趣的礦物。誰知道他們在打什麼主意，但他們對那東西可保護得緊呢！",
    ["Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."] = "在你休息之前，再和托卡談談。你不在的時候，我想他完成了幾件武器。為了感謝你在這裡的幫助，他想把其中一件送給你。",
    ["There's a high demand for the succulent taste of crawler meat among my customers; especially the meat from the monstrous crawlers."] = "我的顧客對爬行者肉的鮮美滋味需求很大，尤其是巨型爬行者的肉。",
    ["Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."] = "把穆塞克灌注進武器是一個困難的過程。現在我已經備齊了所有必需的材料，以及你捕獲的生物的穆塞克，我可以開始了。",
    ["So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."] = "所以，現在就是時候了嗎？我感謝你的努力，如果情況不允許的話，那就讓我現在感謝你為我和我家人所做的一切。",
    ["Black dragons kill many ogre. Kill Tharg's wife."] = "黑龍殺很多食人魔。殺塔格的老婆。",
    ["For all the work that you have done, you deserve to be well rewarded. Return to Delgren and tell him that Athrikus Narassin lies stilled by your hand, and the Cult of the Dark Strand is beaten and scattered."] = "為你所做的一切，你值得獲得豐厚的獎賞。回到德爾格倫那裡，告訴他阿瑟里庫斯·納拉辛已在你手下安息，黑暗之鏈教團已被擊敗並潰散。",
    ["A while ago, I had an incident with the Shadowforge Dwarves. They brought me to Angor Fortress to study two types of strange stones from Uldaman."] = "不久前，我和影爐矮人發生了一次衝突。他們把我帶到安格爾要塞，研究來自奧達曼的兩種奇怪石頭。",
    ["The Druids of the Fang broke from Cenarius and let the Emerald Nightmare into the Wailing Caverns. These were theirs."] = "尖牙德魯伊背離了塞納留斯，把翡翠夢魘放進了哀嚎洞穴。這些是屬於他們的。",
    ["The spiders of the Searing Gorge are an invaluable source of shadow silk. As you know, shadow silk is highly sought after by the artisans of our trade."] = "灼熱峽谷的蜘蛛是暗影絲綢的寶貴來源。如你所知，暗影絲綢深受我們行業工匠的追捧。",
    ["They call themselves the Undermarket: Cutthroat traders that will sell, move, trade and do just about anything for the right price. It gets worse."] = "他們自稱「地下市場」：只要價錢合適，就會買賣、轉運、交易，幾乎什麼都幹的亡命商人。事情還在變糟。",
    ["A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."] = "我在卡林多的一位同事，藥劑師赫爾布林，正在研究羅德隆毒素對卡林多野獸的影響。他會對倫費雷爾寄給我的狼心樣本非常感興趣。",
    ["This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."] = "這卷軸來自那個詭計多端的樹精琳塞麗爾，石爪峰利爪巢穴的鑰匙守護者。她不會再和你從他身上搜出這個的信使聯繫了，嘿，不過我們必須在這裡堅守陣地。",
    ["This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."] = "這塊碎片蘊含著巨大的祕密；它是翡翠夢境的純粹精華。然而，我在這塊碎片中看到的不是夢；人們會把這種幻象稱為噩夢。",
    ["Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item. May it serve you well in your fight against the legion."] = "請從中拿走一件古老的聖物。我們已經用不著這件東西了。願它在你對抗軍團的戰鬥中好好為你效力。",
    ["the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration."] = "每件武器的製作都需要一些時間。此外，惡魔詛咒的力量每三分鐘只能使用一次。它對污染者拉澤利克及其爪牙的削弱效果，持續時間可能各不相同。",
    ["Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."] = "奧妮克希亞的子嗣已散布在龍霧之地。絕不能再讓更多的雛龍孵化。趕緊前往塵泥沼澤南邊的龍窩沼澤。",
    ["Big dragons come and make fire at old home. Me smart ogre."] = "大龍來，在老家噴火。我聰明食人魔。",
    ["Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring."] = "在這荒野裡，金達爾和我沒什麼像樣的東西來酬謝你的幫助，但我們不想讓你覺得沒有被感激。收下我的印章戒指。",
    ["Tymor didn't give me anything to pay you with, so I suggest you take it up with him when you get back to Ironforge. I'm sure he'll still be in his place in the Mystic Ward."] = "泰莫沒給我任何東西來付你報酬，所以我建議你回到鐵爐堡後直接去找他。我相信他還在神祕區他的老地方。",
    ["Return to Belgrom in Orgrimmar. He will want to see her head for himself! We'll return there shortly. Ah, this is indeed a good day. Thank you for your help."] = "回到奧格瑪的貝爾格羅姆那裡。他會想親眼看看她的頭顱！我們很快也會回到那裡。啊，今天真是個好日子。謝謝你的幫助。",
    ["It... It... It was all a trap. Forgive... me. Kill the bastard... Kill him for us... for Thorius."] = "這……這……這全是個陷阱。原諒……我。殺了那個混蛋……為我們殺了他……為索里烏斯。",
    ["Will you assist me, mortal? Will you find the prayer to Elune? As I stated, the prayer was etched onto a golden tablet. One of these idol worshipping scoundrels must have it on their person."] = "你願意幫助我嗎，凡人？你願意找到向伊露恩的祈禱文嗎？就像我說的，祈禱文刻在一塊金色石板上。這些崇拜偶像的惡棍中，一定有人隨身帶著它。",
    ["Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"] = "馬森大師的指示非常明確：把一篇非常重要的論文交給守衛者瑪哈爾·巴，他在守望堡。但我從來沒去過詛咒之地！",
    ["Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar. Take the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth."] = "現在是時候捕獲哈卡的化身的精華了。把哈卡之卵帶到艾澤拉斯沉沒的神廟裡墮落之神的聖殿。",
    ["Razelikh's lair is atop the highest mountain in the Blasted Lands. The only way to the lair is through the use of the teleport runes near the mountain."] = "拉澤利克的巢穴位於詛咒之地最高的山頂上。通往巢穴的唯一道路是使用山附近的傳送符文。",
    ["My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life."] = "我的族人穆拉·符文圖騰前往銀松森林，希望能幫助我們的不死盟友。銀松森林是一片病態的森林，一片垂死的森林，穆拉希望給它帶來新生。",
    ["In the Barrens lies a horrid mess of tangled vines called Razorfen Downs. While our first observations of this place revealed little threat, our recent findings are much more serious..."] = "在貧瘠之地有一片可怕的糾纏藤蔓，叫做剃刀高地。雖然我們最初的觀察顯示這裡幾乎沒有威脅，但我們最近的發現嚴重得多……",
    ["I'm a scientist, but also a treasure hunter at heart! Long ago, when trolls used to occupy this land, they created large amounts of ornaments modeled after Gahz'rilla, a hydra they worshipped as a deity."] = "我是一名科學家，但骨子裡也是個尋寶獵人！很久以前，當食人妖佔據這片土地時，他們製作了大量以加茲瑞拉為原型的飾品，那是一頭他們當作神靈崇拜的多頭蛇。",
    ["A like you must get pretty hungry out here in The Barrens. Me, I'm starving all day long. Tell you what, I'll fix you up a nice stew. Just need a few dig rats."] = "像你這樣的人在貧瘠之地一定很容易餓吧。我呢，整天都餓得慌。這樣吧，我給你做一鍋美味的燉菜。只需要幾隻挖掘鼠。",
    ["It has become obvious that we cannot ensure that Blacklash and Hematus will remain imprisoned in Lethlor."] = "很明顯，我們無法保證黑鞭和海馬圖斯會一直被囚禁在雷索洛。",
    ["I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."] = "我曾經帶著榮譽、忠誠和自豪為血色十字軍效力。我曾相信他們的事業是高尚的：把不死生物從艾澤拉斯清除出去。",
    ["I used to sail a ship from here all the way to Ratchet, in Kalimdor. I was a successful captain with a sterling reputation. Until... Those cursed sea giants ruined me!"] = "我以前駕著船從這裡一路航行到卡林多的棘齒城。我是一位成功的船長，名聲卓著。直到……那些該死的海巨人毀了我！",
    ["I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first."] = "我想我能修好薩莫蘭吉，不過我首先需要使用者手冊。",
    ["General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."] = "將軍莎恩迪絲·羽月想親自和你談談。",
    ["What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."] = "什麼？！啊，我確實提過賞金，是嗎？嗯，這下我該學會管住嘴了，對吧？活是你幹的，所以我想你理應獲得最大的回報。",
    ["In Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death."] = "在安戈洛環形山，有長著致命利爪的迅猛龍。其中一些迅猛龍的爪子有時是白色的，而不是像死亡一樣的黑色。",
    ["My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."] = "我弟弟里布利一直是家裡的拖累，拿我們的錢浪費在一個又一個計畫上。",
    ["My physical being ceased functioning after an hour of this torture. The beast then ripped my wedding nose-ring off of my face and stuck it on his finger."] = "這樣的折磨持續了一個小時後，我的肉體停止了運作。隨後那頭野獸從我臉上扯下我的結婚鼻環，戴在了牠自己的手指上。",
    ["your help has been immeasurable. The time will come, no doubt, when I'll ask for your assistance against the silithid once more."] = "你的幫助是無法估量的。毫無疑問，總有一天，我會再次請求你協助對抗異種蟲族。",
    ["Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."] = "費伍德曾經是一片平靜安寧的土地……直到軍團佔領了它。地獄火、毀滅、混亂……古爾丹的頭骨確保這裡沒有誰能倖免。",
    ["A second encampment of satyrs threatens the land of Felwood towards the north, led by the cruel Xavaric. The vile betrayers and tricksters feed upon the corruption of the native creatures of Felwood."] = "第二個薩特營地威脅著北邊的費伍德，由殘酷的薩瓦里克領導。這些邪惡的叛徒和騙子以費伍德本地生物的腐化為食。",
    ["This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."] = "這將是最困難的部分，因為計畫有些複雜。在這裡的北邊，你會發現一條通往山裡的小徑。",
    ["Let me to be frank with you. I'm interested - nay, concerned with why the Arch Druid in Darnassus is using the name of the Cenarion Circle as well as the Circle's resources to procure vast amounts of morrowgrain."] = "讓我坦率地跟你說。我很感興趣——不，是擔憂——為什麼達納蘇斯的大德魯伊要使用塞納里奧議會的名義和議會的資源，去採購大量的晨穀。",
    ["I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."] = "我現在終於想起來了……我確實是來這裡與烈焰奔行者戰鬥的。我正在旅途中，這應該是最後一步。但我不再是英雄了……",
    ["You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind."] = "你會以為當馬歇爾探險隊的首席挖掘工就意味著我喜歡挖掘。這世上也許有更糟糕的事……但我一時還真想不出來。",
    ["Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."] = "呃……好熱……我正在探索這片區域，突然間熱得受不了了。我一定是中暑了。",
    ["I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."] = "我在製造一台飛行機器！我被困在這裡了，而且我特別不擅長認路。我本可以乘獅鷲或風騎士回加基森，但那些野獸嚇死我了。",
    ["The Dark Iron dwarves, led by the villain Hurley Blackbreath, stole one of the Thunderbrew's best recipes, Thunderbrew Lager. The villains! They don't deserve such a fine brew!, I have a tough task for you."] = "黑鐵矮人在惡棍赫利·黑息的帶領下，偷走了雷酒家族最好的配方之一，雷酒拉格啤酒。這些惡棍！他們不配擁有這樣的好酒！我有一項艱鉅的任務要交給你。",
    ["Bolvar is a fool. I was gathering his precious 'proof' so that I could shove it down his throat. He is a blind buffoon. Proof stands two feet away from him and he does not see."] = "博爾瓦是個傻瓜。我一直在收集他珍貴的「證據」，好把它塞進他的喉嚨裡。他是個瞎眼的蠢貨。證據就在他兩英尺開外，他卻看不見。",
    ["We need to get out of here. Help me get my gear back from the supply area and free my friends. If we make it out of here, you are to proceed to Morgan's Vigil and speak with Marshal Maxwell."] = "我們得離開這裡。幫我從補給區拿回我的裝備，並救出我的朋友。如果我們能逃出去，你就前往摩根的崗哨，和元帥麥克斯韋爾談談。",
    ["As if crashing into the Loch wasn't bad enough, troggs from the nearby island attacked me and stole my tools and special Blastenheimer Blastencapper explosives."] = "撞進湖裡已經夠糟了，附近島嶼上的穴居人又攻擊了我，偷走了我的工具和特製的布拉斯騰海默爆破炸藥。",
    ["I look at my undeath as a malady. An illness that merely requires treatment; however, it is also a great blessing for the Argent Dawn. What better vessel to smite the heathens of the Scourge than through the undead?"] = "我把自己的不死狀態看作一種病。一種只需要治療的疾病；然而，這對銀色黎明也是一種巨大的福祉。還有什麼比不死生物更適合作為容器去打擊天譴軍團的異教徒呢？",
    ["I draw my power - my will to continue living and breathing - from the unmitigated hatred I have for the Scourge and all that they have done."] = "我的力量——我繼續活著和呼吸的意志——來自我對天譴軍團及其所作所為的無盡仇恨。",
    ["Take this letter back to Stormwind and let Malin know that Kryten an' I'll be home soon. He'll reward you well for helping us here, of that I've no doubt."] = "把這封信帶回暴風城，告訴馬林，克萊頓和我很快就會回家。他會好好獎勵你在這裡幫助我們的，這一點我毫不懷疑。",
    ["We've learned that a source of furbolg corruption is from the satyr. They hold sway via talismans that they channel magic through. If the furbolg have a chance at salvation, we must lure out the satyr corruptor and take that talisman!"] = "我們得知熊怪腐化的一個來源是薩特。他們透過護符施加影響，魔法經由這些護符導出。如果熊怪還有獲救的機會，我們必須引出薩特腐化者並奪取那枚護符！",
    ["I was on my way to Maestra's Post to meet Liladris Moonriver, but I decided to stop here and take a short nap. Ever since I awoke from the emerald dream, I have been so sleepy..."] = "我正要去馬埃斯特拉哨站見莉拉德里斯·月河，但我決定在這裡停一下，小睡片刻。自從我從翡翠夢境醒來，我就一直這麼睏……",
    ["The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."] = "月亮井的水顯示，水晶裡嵌著幾小塊骨頭碎片，還有半塊下顎骨。",
    ["That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."] = "那隻擱淺的生物在黑海岸並非個案。沿海岸線甚至水裡還有更多。",
    ["I love crab. Crabs are the fruit of the sea! You can bake it, barbecue it, boil it, and broil it. They're pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried."] = "我愛吃螃蟹。螃蟹是海裡的水果！可以烤、可以燒烤、可以煮、可以炙。有煎的、油炸的、爆炒的。",
    ["I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."] = "我見過基內洛莉在酒館過了一夜後比現在糟糕得多的樣子。你顯然把她保護得很好。",
    ["you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."] = "你過去對我們很有幫助，所以現在我把一項重要的任務交給你。恐怖圖騰氏族正在暗中密謀。最近幾週，有三名來歷不明的密探被人看到拜訪恐怖圖騰。",
    ["But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."] = "但是，也許半人馬比我想像的要多，我請求你與我一起對抗這些卑劣的刺客。",
    ["Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."] = "把這份提煉並淨化過的燃燒粉末帶到千針石林，把它丟進神聖的生命之火中。它位於黑雲峰，在一根偏僻的石針上，那是他們埋葬死者的地方。",
    ["Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."] = "阿爾納克以為我們會結婚……可我拒絕了他的求婚，他當晚就回來把我綁走了。我哥哥想阻止他，可阿爾納克太強了。",
    ["Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."] = "通緝：阿爾納克·恐怖圖騰。被放逐者阿爾納克因謀殺和綁架等惡行遭到通緝。凡有勇氣將這名罪犯繩之以法者，將獲得豐厚的賞金。",
    ["You have the look of a fisherman! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?"] = "你有漁夫的模樣！我喜歡釣魚——釣了一輩子魚。最好的魚餌是軟殼蛤蜊肉；魚根本抵擋不住，你懂我的意思吧？",
    ["Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop."] = "通常情況下，里格和我會帶著我們的科多獸從科卡爾半人馬旁邊經過。偶爾我們會聽到半人馬的戰鼓聲，一聽到那聲音我們就停下。",
    ["We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."] = "我告訴你，我們坐在一座金礦上——一座金礦！科多獸的骨頭將永遠改變世界……我有客戶用它做傢俱、樂器，甚至火藥。",
    ["Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership."] = "嗯，唯一敢在這一帶旅行的商隊就靠我。自從我學會用我的科多獸重振器讓年老垂死的科多獸恢復活力並加以控制，商隊老闆科克、里格和我就結成了合夥關係。",
    ["Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."] = "這是用你找回的費伍德樣本製成的封裝軟泥。把盒子帶到安戈洛環形山，找一隻純淨的軟泥怪……原始種類就很合適。",
    ["Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."] = "在你和我說話之前，我就聽說了你的事蹟……說你有一種不屈不撓的證明自己的渴望，說你有非凡的能力，現在我知道這些都是真的。",
    ["You pick up the sack carefully and prepare to make your way back to Jessir Moonbow on the border of Felwood and Ashenvale. Hopefully the paladin will be given the proper respects once you've passed his remains on to his friends."] = "你小心翼翼地拿起袋子，準備返回費伍德和梣谷交界處的傑西爾·月弓那裡。希望等你把聖騎士的遺骸交給他的朋友們之後，他能得到應有的尊敬。",
    ["Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."] = "不幸的是，我看唯一能阻止費伍德這場威脅的辦法是正面進攻。進入暗影要塞沒有其他路，我也沒有辦法把你傳送進去。",
    ["In northern Winterspring, great cats assemble around a large landmark called Frostsaber Rock. The leader of these cats is known by the name Shy-Rotam."] = "在冬泉谷北部，大貓們聚集在一處名叫霜刃岩的大型地標周圍。這些大貓的首領名叫羞怯羅坦。",
    ["While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."] = "雖然我們對熊怪為何一直在攝入這種奇怪的物質仍然知之甚少，但我確實認為，最好在事態失控之前阻止它。",
    ["To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."] = "說實話，雖然冬泉谷這裡沒有火山，但我認為這些溫泉背後有更具威脅的原因……",
    ["Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."] = "相當令人印象深刻。辛瑪洛之晶永遠無法歸還神殿，而你也知道，神殿已成廢墟。但我認為，你為消除過去的邪惡所做的努力不該沒有回報。",
    ["The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."] = "牛頭人德魯伊那毫無生氣的手緊握著一根看上去出奇健康的橡木樹枝。檢查樹枝，你發現樹皮上刻著德魯伊風格的符文。",
    ["Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted."] = "安多哈爾的時間線被一股邪惡力量——很可能是天譴軍團——竄改了！我可以嘗試保持這裡時間流逝的完整，並修復被損壞的部分，但我需要你的幫助才能不受打擾地完成。",
    ["In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."] = "在木喉，我們很滿足。我們不喜歡陌生人。這對我們有好處，但對貿易不利。不久前，一位難得的暗夜精靈朋友來到木喉，她穿著一件符文布斗篷。",
    ["Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"] = "爸爸讓我把這把鑰匙給你。他說它能打開房子後面的一只箱子。他還想讓我謝謝你。你是不是幫過他的忙？",
    ["Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!"] = "好了，一切都準備好、打包好，可以運走了！祝你旅途順利，一定要告訴廷克，她欠我的！",
    ["There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram!"] = "東南方有一座山谷，白骨谷，有瑪格拉姆的幽靈出沒。聽起來很嚇人，對吧？那你想想，對瑪格拉姆來說有多嚇人！",
    ["The amount of salve made out of the reagents you brought me is good enough for ten doses. While I work with the village to try and make some more salve, I'd like for you to help us get a head start."] = "用你帶來的材料製成的藥膏足夠用十次。我與村子一起努力製作更多藥膏的時候，我希望你能幫我們搶先一步。",
    ["You have completed the necessary lessons all young druids are taught before they can adopt an aquatic aspect. Go now back to your trainer, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, in Darnassus."] = "你已完成所有年輕德魯伊在採用水生形態之前必須學習的課程。現在回到你的訓練師達納蘇斯的馬瑟倫吉爾·熊行者那裡去吧。",
    ["That's fascinating! I have always wondered about the truth... Well, you must share this knowledge, definitely! Go to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm right away -- you'll find him in Darnassus, in the Cenarion Circle."] = "太迷人了！我一直都想知道真相……嗯，你必須分享這個知識，當然！馬上去找大德魯伊范達爾·鹿盔——你會在達納蘇斯的塞納里奧議會找到他。",
    ["The Earthen Ring is a shamanistic group dedicated to studying and preserving the elements. They have forgotten more about crazy old gods, ancient legends and lore than most scholars will ever know."] = "大地之環是致力於研究和保護元素的薩滿團體。他們遺忘的關於瘋狂的上古之神、古老傳說和典故的東西，比大多數學者一輩子能知道的還要多。",
    ["Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound."] = "就在最近，一大群游牧食人魔來到了塔納利斯。在這裡的南邊，他們佔據了沙漠裡的一大片區域，建起了營地。",
    ["I just picked up this shredder from Ratchet and I was on my way back to the Warsong Lumber Camp, where I am supposed to be on duty."] = "我剛從棘齒城取了這台伐木機，正在回戰歌伐木場的路上，我應該在那裡值班。",
    ["I entrust you with the Gem of the Serpent. Place this gem on the Serpent Statue's hand on Ranazjar Isle, a small island northwest of here. Placing it will summon the one who protects the Book of the Ancients."] = "我把蛇之寶石託付給你。把這塊寶石放在拉納茲賈島上蛇像的手裡，那是這裡西北方的一座小島。放上去就會召喚出守護上古之書的存在。",
    ["Behold - the Hand of Iruxos. A gruesome sight indeed. You must possess it if the demon portals at Mannoroc Coven are to be banished... which is what I now ask you to do."] = "看——伊魯索斯之手。確實是一幅可怕的景象。如果要驅逐瑪諾洛克巢穴的惡魔傳送門，你就必須擁有它……這就是我現在請你做的事。",
    ["The defeated water elemental has left behind a strange water globe. You surmise that the object somehow fed the beast energy. Inside the globe, a putrid-looking form of water sloshes about."] = "被擊敗的水元素留下了一顆奇怪的水球。你推測這東西以某種方式為野獸提供了能量。水球裡面，有一團看上去腐臭的水在晃動。",
    ["Hey!! Come here! My raiders and I are about to attack the Silverwing Outpost to the west. Our target is its leader, Duriel Moonfire. Scouts report the outpost is defended heavily with sentinels and warriors."] = "嘿！！過來！我和我的劫掠者們即將攻擊西邊的銀翼要塞。我們的目標是它的首領，杜里爾·月火。斥候報告說，這座哨站有哨兵和戰士嚴密防守。",
    ["Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk. Besseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair."] = "警告：進入此地以西的希希爾峽谷，後果自負。貝瑟蕾絲和她八條腿的森林之子已把這座峽谷據為自己的蛛網巢穴。",
    ["We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"] = "戰歌伐木場缺少幾樣東西！",
    ["As you have seen, though the land is in pain, the cycle of life is a powerful thing. Now we must do our part help it along. You must plant these seeds at the center of the destruction, to the west, in the Charred Vale."] = "正如你所見，雖然這片土地在痛苦中，但生命的循環是強大的。現在我們必須盡自己的一份力來推動它。你必須把這些種子種在毀滅的中心，西邊的焦炭谷。",
    ["Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"] = "限制血怒鷹身人的數量是不夠的。治癒她們疾病的唯一真正辦法，就是殺死她們的首領，血怒撕裂者！",
    ["Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions. The albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here."] = "是的，蠢貨，也許你已經準備好接受一套更複雜的任務了。白化惡魔蝙蝠，暗翼，在這裡正北邊的鄉間遊蕩。",
    ["Past the Argent Dawn encampment of Light's Hope and west of Northdale, you will find the corpulent maggot beast, Borelgore. I've lost entire regiments to that monster."] = "經過銀色黎明的希望之光營地，在北谷以西，你會找到那頭肥胖的蛆蟲野獸，博雷戈爾。我有整整幾個團毀在那頭怪物手裡。",
    ["another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat."] = "另一個熊怪部落，污染者部落，住在阿斯特蘭納東南面。他們不像荊棘毛那麼多，但他們的兇猛構成了未來的威脅。",
    ["Malcin claims he is outside Razorfen Downs. This ambassador must be slain--his mission a failure in the eyes of the Lich King."] = "馬爾辛聲稱自己在剃刀高地外面。這位大使必須被殺死——他的任務在巫妖王眼中已經失敗。",
    ["A pit lord left behind when the Legion's invasion collapsed, still holding the Tainted Scar where the Dark Portal's blast burned the land."] = "軍團入侵崩潰後被遺留下來的一名深淵領主，仍然守著黑暗之門爆炸燒焦土地所留下的污染傷疤。",
    ["Ragnaros wielded this hammer as the Firelord. Reforging it means taking the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros himself and setting it into the Sulfuron Hammer."] = "拉格納羅斯作為火焰之王時曾揮舞這把錘子。重鑄它意味著要從拉格納羅斯本人手中取走薩弗拉斯之眼，並把它鑲嵌到薩弗隆錘上。",
    ["While you were gathering the supplies, I had some of my people handle marking the Scourge buildings we need demolished. Here's the plan: I'm going to give you ten sticks of my special compound."] = "你收集補給的時候，我讓我的一些人負責標記我們需要拆除的天譴軍團建築。計畫是這樣的：我要給你十根我的特製炸藥。",
    ["This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan. The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature. They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."] = "這個暮光之錘的追隨者不能被允許完成他的計畫。暮光之錘不瞭解自然之靈。他們相信的是上古之神——很久以前就被擊敗的混亂與毀滅的生物。",
    ["A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."] = "大地元素的公主，也是瑪拉頓被毒化的原因——她的核心處守著她的半神配偶扎埃塔爾的遺體。",
    ["Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship."] = "在瑪拉頓深處住著一個邪惡的混亂生物——瑟拉德拉斯公主，是與上古之神有關的大地元素之力。很久以前，她和塞納留斯的長子扎埃塔爾開始了一段關係。",
    ["The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."] = "特拉莫克的水晶洞窟在西邊，深藏在瑪拉頓之中……那是一個歷史悠久的古老之地。我想弄到其中的一些東西。",
    ["A satyr known as Vyletongue has corrupted the caverns of Maraudon, stunting the growth of many of the plants inside. Take this vial."] = "一個名叫邪舌的薩特腐化了瑪拉頓的洞窟，阻礙了裡面許多植物的生長。拿著這個小瓶。",
    ["You have earned reverence among the Guard. Present your insignia!"] = "你在守衛中贏得了崇敬。出示你的徽記！",
    ["Rise and be honored! Present your insignia."] = "起身接受榮耀！出示你的徽記。",
    ["Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature."] = "你的時刻又到了。你獲得了新的軍階，因此也獲得了標誌這一地位提升的新徽記。",
    ["I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf."] = "我沒想到你會回來。唉，你已證明自己是霜狼的一名勇敢而光榮的戰士。",
    ["Your radiate command and power, shaman. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name."] = "你散發著指揮與力量的氣息，薩滿。在霜狼眼中受到崇尚——敵人一聽到你的名字就瑟瑟發抖。",
    ["You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander."] = "你已贏得了統御之眼。出示你的徽記，指揮官。",
    ["your services to the Warlords surpassed all we could expect from the denizens of this world. We do not understand your people's notions of gratitude, or rewarding good works, but in this case..."] = "你為戰爭領主們提供的服務超出了我們對這個世界居民的一切期望。我們不理解你們種族對感謝或獎賞善行的觀念，但這一次……",
    ["Anyway, you should check back with me relatively soon... that is if you want to know what was in here. As soon as I find out what it is, and if it's indeed a book, I'd be happy to share that information with you."] = "不管怎樣，你應該很快回來找我……如果你想知道裡面是什麼的話。一旦我弄清楚它是什麼，如果它確實是一本書，我很樂意與你分享這些資訊。",
    ["Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength. Do not keep your public waiting, hero."] = "大酋長倫薩克正在力量谷等候你的到來。別讓你的觀眾久等，英雄。",
    ["The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."] = "火焰之王，四大元素領主之一，被束縛在元素位面，直到黑鐵矮人在黑石山下將他召喚出來。這次召喚使山體裂開，形成了熔火之心。",
    ["A hound handler of Ragnaros's court, who curses healing shut before the fighting starts."] = "拉格納羅斯宮廷裡的獵犬馴養者，在戰鬥開始之前就詛咒治療失效。",
    ["Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!"] = "喂，旱鴨子！給我帶來12個競技場大師飾品，你就是古拉巴什競技場的宗師了！",
    ["You've done doubly well in addressing the threat that the Zukk'ash insects pose to Camp Mojache. The threat these things pose is far from over, and I'd like to ask you for one last task on behalf of the Horde."] = "你在處理祖卡什昆蟲對莫沙徹營地的威脅上做得加倍出色。這些東西構成的威脅遠未結束，我想代表部落請你完成最後一項任務。",
    ["When doing this though, be sure to save me the water elemental cores!"] = "這麼做的時候，一定要給我留下水元素之核！",
    ["I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis."] = "我有一條更好的皮革來源的線索，如果這真能讓人相信的話！在菲拉斯北部——深入暴怒傷疤要塞——還有另一群雪人。",
    ["The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."] = "入侵的雷矛並不是這一地區唯一的威脅，士兵。山谷裡的戰爭在兩條戰線上展開。食人的冬斧食人妖也在爭奪權力。",
    ["Return to my mate, Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village. Tell her that I am coming home! She is sure to reward you."] = "回到雷矛村我的伴侶，原始者斷牙那裡。告訴她我要回家了！她一定會獎賞你的。",
    ["Like many in our village, I too have lost a loved one to the wilds. Alas, it was my twin brother Malkhor - taken in the same raid as Torntusk's mate by the Vilebranch."] = "和我們村裡的許多人一樣，我也因荒野失去了一位摯愛的人。唉，那是我的雙胞胎兄弟馬爾科爾——和斷牙的伴侶在同一次襲擊中被邪枝部落抓走了。",
    ["You take this, mon. You take this to Aerie Peak, dead center of town by the well. You plant it! Drive it right into the ground! Show those dwarves that troll mean business!"] = "你拿著這個，夥計。把這個帶到鷹巢山，鎮子正中央的井邊。你把它種下去！直接插進地裡！讓那些矮人看看食人妖是認真的！",
    ["With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open."] = "隨著衛隊長馬爾科爾的離去，雷矛衛隊長的職位再度空缺。",
    ["By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice! A grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard."] = "奉原始者斷牙之命，邪惡的女祭司赫克絲及其爪牙必須被繩之以法！凡殺死邪惡的女祭司赫克絲及其所有阿曼扎西精英衛隊者，將獲得重賞。",
    ["The following items have been stolen: *One Dark Iron Tuyere. *One Lookout's Spyglass. A reward is being offered to individuals who find and return these pilfered items."] = "下列物品被盜：*黑鐵風口一個。*瞭望者的望遠鏡一個。凡找到並歸還這些被盜物品者將獲得賞金。",
    ["By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."] = "奉監工油拳閣下之命：叛變的瑟銀兄弟會特工、剛被任命為熔爐黑鐵熔渣坑工隊指揮官的監工馬爾托留斯必須被殺，並把他的頭顱帶回作為證明。",
    ["A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments. He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."] = "一頭阿萊克絲塔薩一族的紅龍，被奈法利安的實驗摧殘得面目全非。他請求在腐化徹底吞沒他之前被殺死，並在戰鬥時不斷道歉。",
    ["Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."] = "死亡之翼之子，在黑石山下工作，培育彩色龍群——攜帶全部五色龍血脈的龍。工作進行期間，他以維克多·奈法流斯勳爵的身份在暴風城宮廷中度過了多年。",
    ["One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."] = "守衛奈法利安內殿的三頭龍之一，也是依靠自己造成的傷口來治療自己的那一頭。",
    ["Cut from the fang of one of Nefarian's drakes. Tanks wore it for the stun it shrugs off, not the numbers on it."] = "取自奈法利安一頭龍的尖牙。坦克穿戴它是為了它能無視昏迷，而不是為了上面的數字。",
    ["The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on."] = "奈法利安三頭龍中的最後一頭，也是在戰鬥中只會越來越憤怒的那一頭。",
    ["The ultimate symbol of a haruspex's power is what they wear."] = "占卜師力量的終極象徵就是他們的穿著。",
    ["We Zandalar know not of druidic ways; nature is to be shaped by our need, not the other way around."] = "我們贊達拉人不懂德魯伊的方式；自然應該由我們的需要來塑造，而不是反過來。",
    ["By communion with animals and givin' them up to the spirits when needed, they give us divine guidance. In times past, the haruspex's insight and wisdom gave us an edge in the wars against the splintered tribes of the Gurubashi."] = "透過與動物溝通，並在需要時把牠們獻給靈魂，他們給予我們神聖的指引。在過去，占卜師的洞察和智慧讓我們在對抗分裂的古拉巴什部落的戰爭中佔了上風。",
    ["Hakkar's chief hexxer, who fights by binding pieces of his enemies' spirits and setting them loose."] = "哈卡的首席妖術師，他透過束縛敵人靈魂的碎片再將其放出來戰鬥。",
    ["He must be stopped! Take this sacred cord, and string through it the heads of the high priests responsible for channeling our gods' energy."] = "必須阻止他！拿著這根神聖的繩索，把負責引導我們諸神能量的高階祭司的頭顱串在上面。",
    ["My delvings into the Mosh'aru Tablets bear grim news. Hakkar's true form, the god himself, can be born again through the very egg into which you captured him."] = "我對莫沙魯石板的研究帶來了嚴峻的消息。哈卡的真身，神本身，可以透過你囚禁他的那枚蛋再次誕生。",
    ["One of Ysera's four green consorts, corrupted by the Emerald Nightmare and now roaming Feralas, rotting the ground it stands on."] = "伊瑟拉四位綠色配偶之一，被翡翠夢魘腐化，如今在菲拉斯遊蕩，所站之處土地都在腐爛。",
    ["The waters of Lake Elune'ara should dissolve the nightmares engulfing this object. Give me a moment to perform the cleansing."] = "月神湖的水應該能溶解吞噬這件物品的夢魘。給我一點時間進行淨化。",
    ["A Nightmare-corrupted green dragon who splits himself into shades rather than face a fight whole."] = "一頭被夢魘腐化的綠龍，他把自己分裂成暗影，而不是完整地面對戰鬥。",
    ["They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."] = "他們要我做不可能的事！熱砂港商會想讓我教訓一下南海海盜。",
    ["The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity."] = "可怕的蠍子，死亡之鉗，據信在異種蟲族活動加劇的情況下撤退到了南部山脈。",
    ["We have discovered another base of operations for the Twilight's Hammer. It is called Twilight's Run; it is a cave tucked in the northeast corner of Silithus."] = "我們發現了暮光之錘的另一個行動基地。它叫暮光之徑；是藏在希利蘇斯東北角的一個洞穴。",
    ["I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."] = "我需要你闖入希瓦利斯，查明我最親愛的娜塔莉亞怎麼樣了。這對你來說不會容易。在你一頭栽進瘋狂的深淵之前，一定要回去和那些矮人談談。",
    ["An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."] = "一個上古之神，被泰坦埋葬在安其拉之下而沒有殺死。從那以後它一直在向其拉蟲族低語，整場戰爭的存在就是因為它從未停止過。",
    ["The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."] = "你為塞納里奧要塞執行戰鬥、後勤和戰術任務所收集的徽章，可不只是用來炫耀的。你最好留著它們。",
    ["The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."] = "你為風語者傲角執行戰鬥、後勤和戰術任務所收集的徽章，可不只是用來炫耀的。你最好留著它們。",
    ["I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."] = "我說的是源質，凡人。找到並給我帶來其拉帝國徽記和毒性元素，我就能灌注出強大的武器。",
    ["The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."] = "木喉是唯一躲過腐化的熊怪部落。然而，現在許多其他種族不分敵友地盲目殺戮熊怪。",
    ["There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."] = "在我們的正西南有一座死木熊怪營地。腐化滲透了整個營地，我希望在他們成為問題之前終結它。",
    ["The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."] = "木喉傾向於獨處。雖然我們會讓我們信任的人安全通過，但我們會盡可能避開其他熊怪部落。",
    ["The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."] = "雙子皇帝……他們不停的低語正慢慢侵蝕我的理智。他們嘲弄我，知道我無法再深入他們的領地去救我的兄弟阿魯高斯。",
    ["It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon."] = "我們之間流傳著一種說法：凡人種族所穿的華麗肩甲，最初是為了模仿龍的翅膀。",
    ["The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon. Bring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you."] = "最強大的其拉所用的物品擁有強大的力量，連巨龍也會為之遲疑。把其拉的統御束縛和其他次要材料帶給我，我就為你製作一雙強力的靴子。",
    ["You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."] = "你想向我族證明你的價值嗎，凡人？很好，也許我們可以互相幫助。遠古沙蟲奧羅是一位擁有傳奇力量的存在。",
    ["The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."] = "那位不可名狀的上古之神正從安其拉下的沉睡中慢慢甦醒。等待艾澤拉斯的可怕命運可能在幾天或幾年內降臨；對擁有他那種力量的存在來說，時間毫無意義。",
    ["The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong."] = "其拉和他們的僕從所用的物品由最稀有、最精良的材料製成：來自巨大古老生物的骨頭，來自地底深處的寶石，純淨而堅固的金屬。",
    ["The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings."] = "據說其拉副官們佩戴的戒指賦予他們強大的能力。裝飾這些戒指的腐化寶石，理論上可以換成更純淨的材料，製作出未被腐化的戒指。",
    ["I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."] = "很高興聽說你在協助我們進攻安其拉。我可以給你做一件防護用品，對對抗我們的敵人會有幫助。",
    ["A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."] = "一個可怕的威脅已被平息。殘酷的奧斯里安已被擊敗。卡林多的居民得知這場勝利一定會鬆一口氣。",
    ["I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book!"] = "我早該想到的。我的死敵，威比爾博士，又在耍老花招！而現在，多虧你在冬泉谷的失敗，威比爾博士毀掉了我的書！",
    ["Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit."] = "我提過壞消息了嗎？它的名字叫巨口：100英尺長的死亡與毀滅。我想我可能忘了說這個小細節。",
    ["Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it..."] = "勇士，是你嗎？自從我被託付這塊碎片以來已經過去了一千年，而偏偏在我最黑暗的時刻，會有人站出來為我卸下它……",
    ["We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."] = "我們必須對埃拉尼庫斯手下留情。我們要救贖他，而不是毀滅他。泰蘭德已經在趕來協助我們完成這項任務的路上。我們必須承受巨龍的攻擊，拯救夜之港免於必然的毀滅。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."] = "其拉的雙子皇帝之一，繼承了克蘇恩的魔法天賦，而非他兄弟的力量。兩個雙子中任何一個都不能在遠離另一個的地方被殺死。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."] = "其拉的雙子皇帝之一，也是這對兄弟中更強壯的一方。殺死一個，另一個會為他治療，所以兩個必須同時倒下。",
    ["A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."] = "一條在沙漠下長到巨大的沙蟲，只有覓食時才會浮出地面。",
    ["A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."] = "一名其拉育母，毒性強到這場戰鬥其實就是一場與她毒液的賽跑。",
    ["A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."] = "一隻巨大的其拉掘地者，戰鬥中途會孵化幼蟲，並把入侵者擲向牆壁。",
    ["The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."] = "其拉帝國最優秀的戰士，與她的榮譽衛隊並肩作戰，拒絕與他們分開。",
    ["A living mass of qiraji poison. It has to be frozen solid and then shattered, which is not how most things die."] = "一團活著的其拉毒液。它必須被凍結成堅冰然後粉碎，這可不是大多數東西的死法。",
    ["One of the three qiraji councillors who fight as one -- kill any of them and the survivors grow stronger."] = "三位像一個人那樣戰鬥的其拉議員之一——殺死其中任何一個，倖存者就會變得更強。",
    ["The third of the qiraji council, who charges the moment the fight begins and does not stop."] = "其拉議會的第三位，戰鬥一開始就衝鋒，而且不會停下。",
    ["C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."] = "克蘇恩的傳聲筒。其拉所相信的一切，都是因為他告訴他們那是上古之神說的。",
    ["To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord:Lady;. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection."] = "前往時光之穴吧，領主/女士。阿納克洛斯在等你歸來。把克蘇恩之眼交給他，因為他無疑會想把它放進他主人的收藏中。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要讓你繼續有興趣拯救我這條命，就該給你一份獎賞。把你想要升級的腰帶和手套帶給我。",
    ["Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."] = "瓦爾薩拉克的靈魂被保存在這條護符裡。出於貪婪，我們愚蠢地把它分成了三部分，卻不知等待我們的是什麼詛咒。阻止瓦爾薩拉克法術的唯一辦法就是把這枚勳章重新拼合起來。",
    ["I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor."] = "我擁有一套很像你們這個職業的人所穿的護甲，但品質要高得多。我願意用這副護腕換你一副普通的，條件是你幫我一個小忙。",
    ["That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut."] = "真是個精彩的故事！謝謝你，也代表所有相關人員向你致以衷心的感謝。現在也許我晚上睡覺時能閉上兩隻眼睛了。",
    ["Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."] = "但我可不是隨便施恩的人，即使你是一位老朋友派來的。我對我們粗野的食人魔鄰居只有仇恨和蔑視。",
    ["My brother and I run the poison operations out of the manor Ravenholdt."] = "我和我弟弟從烏鴉嶺莊園經營毒藥生意。",
    ["From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes."] = "陣亡者的屍體上，護甲被剝下並帶回納克薩瑪斯，用於不明用途。",
    ["The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered. Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it."] = "守護者的法杖，破碎並散落各處。重建它意味著要從納克薩瑪斯收集四十塊碎片，從克爾蘇加德那裡取得底座，並把它帶到卡拉贊廢墟，那是麥迪文曾經保管它的地方。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial wrists."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作冰川護腕了。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"] = "你好，朋友。你有想用來兌換強大物品的黎明或十字軍徽記嗎？",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial cloak."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作冰川披風了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Polar tunic."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作極地外套了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar gloves."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作極地手套了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作極地護腕了。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."] = "你好，朋友。你有想用來兌換強大物品的黎明或十字軍徽記嗎？我必須警告你：在與黎明的聲望為友善時進行的購買會附加極其高昂的附加費。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with a hefty surcharge."] = "你好，朋友。你有想用來兌換強力物品的黎明或十字軍徽記嗎？我必須警告你：在與黎明的聲望為友善時進行的購買會附加高昂的附加費。",
    ["You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?"] = "你自認為是黎明的英雄，是吧？我見過我們最偉大的戰士被克爾蘇加德的雜兵碾壓！像你這樣一無所知的人，在納克薩瑪斯能有多大作為？",
    ["A crypt lord of Azjol-Nerub who took Arthas's side. He holds the Arachnid Quarter's outermost hall."] = "一名站在阿薩斯一邊的阿杰·奈魯布墓穴領主。他把守著蛛魔區最外層的大廳。",
    ["A worshipper of Kel'Thuzad who brought her followers with her into undeath, and still commands them."] = "克爾蘇加德的崇拜者，她帶著她的追隨者一同進入不死狀態，至今仍指揮著他們。",
    ["A giant spider webbed into the depths of the Arachnid Quarter, fed on whatever the Scourge no longer needs."] = "一隻被蛛網困在蛛魔區深處的巨型蜘蛛，以天譴軍團不再需要的東西為食。",
    ["An abomination stitched together from the Scourge's leftovers, built for nothing but raw strength."] = "一頭由天譴軍團的剩餘物縫合而成的憎惡，造出來除了蠻力別無他用。",
    ["A stitched hound kept half-starved on purpose, so it would eat anything the Construct Quarter sent its way."] = "一頭縫合而成的獵犬，被故意養得半飢半飽，好讓牠吃掉構造區送來的任何東西。",
    ["A death knight who trains the Scourge's new officers. He is too strong for his own students to touch, which is exactly the point of the lesson."] = "一名訓練天譴軍團新軍官的死亡騎士。他強大到連他自己的學生也碰不到他，而這正是這堂課的要點。",
    ["Razuvious's colleague in the Military Quarter, who fights from behind his own dead and keeps sending them forward."] = "拉蘇維奧斯在軍事區的同僚，他躲在自己的亡者身後戰鬥，並不斷把他們送上前線。",
    ["A necromancer of the Plague Quarter, promoted for his skill at raising what he had just finished killing."] = "瘟疫區的一名死靈法師，因擅長復活自己剛殺死的東西而獲得晉升。",
    ["Keeper of Naxxramas's plague works, and of the corridor of eruptions that has killed more raiders than he has."] = "納克薩瑪斯瘟疫工坊的看守者，以及那條比他殺的人還多的噴發走廊的看守者。",
    ["A fungal horror grown in the Plague Quarter's spore vats -- less a creature than a crop that got out of hand."] = "一個在瘟疫區孢子桶裡長出來的真菌恐怖——與其說是生物，不如說是一茬失控的莊稼。",
    ["A blue dragon slain in Northrend and raised as a frost wyrm. He guards the final approach to Kel'Thuzad's chamber."] = "一頭在北裂境被殺死並被復活為霜火巨龍的藍龍。他把守著通往克爾蘇加德房間的最後通道。",
    ["Once an archmage of the Kirin Tor, he left Dalaran to found the Cult of the Damned and served Ner'zhul willingly. Killed at Andorhal and raised as a lich, he rules Naxxramas from a phylactery at its heart."] = "他曾是祈倫托的大法師，離開達拉然創立了詛咒教派，並心甘情願地侍奉奈薩里奧。在安多哈爾被殺並復活為巫妖後，他從位於納克薩瑪斯核心的靈魂容器中統治著這裡。",
    ["Here's your cask of Evershine. And again, thank you for the hunting earlier."] = "這是你的永輝酒桶。再次感謝你之前的狩獵。",
    ["Recently, a new group of thieves has been hanging around Northshire. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, and have been seen across the river to the east."] = "最近，一夥新的盜賊一直在北郡一帶遊蕩。他們自稱迪菲亞兄弟會，有人看到他們在東邊河對岸出沒。",
    ["The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."] = "大地之母的儀式是年輕牛頭人在雷霆崖贏得尊重所必須邁出的步驟。首先你必須通過力量儀式。",
    ["My brother Senir and I were sent to different parts of Dun Morogh to investigate the threat posed by the trolls. The Senate has its hands full with the troggs, so they've no need for further annoyances."] = "我哥哥塞尼爾和我被派往丹莫洛的不同地方，調查食人妖構成的威脅。議會已經被穴居人搞得焦頭爛額，不需要更多的煩惱。",
    ["Scarlet Crusaders have been raiding from the ruined tower in northern Tirisfal, past Faol's Rest. According to the information we have, a ruthless commander named Captain Melrache is in charge of this evil crew."] = "血色十字軍一直在法奧休憩地以外、提里斯法北部的廢棄塔樓裡發動襲擊。根據我們掌握的情報，一名名叫梅爾拉什上尉的無情指揮官負責這夥邪惡的人馬。",
    ["Your cleansing of the Winterhoof and Thunderhorn wells is spoken among the spirits, young. The Wildmane Totem is made, and your last task lies ahead."] = "你淨化冬蹄和雷角水井的事在靈魂之間傳頌，年輕人。野鬃圖騰已經製成，你最後的任務就在前方。",
    ["Gazlowe told me once, \"Rezlak. There's one thing you need to know in life, and that's if you want something done well, do it yourself.\" I can't deal with losing all our caravans, so I'm just going to take matters into my own hands."] = "加茲魯維曾經對我說：「雷茲拉克。人生中你需要知道一件事，那就是如果你想把事情做好，就自己動手。」我無法忍受失去我們所有的商隊，所以我要自己動手了。",
    ["My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."] = "我的日誌！他們把它帶到洞穴裡去了。拿著它的那個……是個大塊頭的野獸，皮膚和臉上有些奇怪的印記。我沒看清楚更多了。",
    ["Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."] = "沒有生命縛結者阿萊克絲塔薩和永恆者諾茲多姆的祝福，泰達希爾的成長並非沒有缺陷。",
    ["You'll be happy to know we appear to be making progress in the mine, thanks in no small part to your efforts. We can now turn our eyes to other concerns."] = "你會很高興地知道，我們在礦坑裡似乎取得了進展，這在很大程度上要歸功於你的努力。現在我們可以把目光轉向其他事務了。",
    ["Two extra attacks on a proc, on a fast axe. Warriors farmed Dire Maul for this one item and nothing else."] = "一把快斧，觸發時額外兩次攻擊。戰士們為了這一件物品反覆刷厄運之槌，別無他求。",
    ["We were deep in a vast mine in Westfall, hidden beneath a barn in Moonbrook. No clue where these stinkin' thieving types came from. Anyway, the mine tunnel collapsed on us."] = "我們當時在西部荒野一座巨大的礦坑深處，藏在月溪的一座穀倉下面。不知道這些臭烘烘的盜賊是從哪裡冒出來的。總之，礦坑坑道在我們頭上塌了。",
    ["Here, take this and lay it on his grave. Maybe... somehow, he'll know that I'm okay, and that none of us hold him responsible for what happened."] = "來，拿著這個放在他的墳上。也許……不知怎麼的，他會知道我沒事，我們誰也不認為這件事要怪他。",
    ["Stalvan Mistmantle led a life of depravity. Innocent victims died by his hand. Undoubtedly he is guilty of countless crimes. Now the lunatic threatens Darkshire."] = "史塔爾文·霧衣過著墮落的生活。無辜的受害者死在他手上。毫無疑問，他犯下了無數罪行。現在這個瘋子威脅著暮色森林。",
    ["I do not know why, but a festering grows within the Wetlands. Fen Creepers have risen. They are diseased, fevered blisters on the land, and for the fever to break they must be dispatched and allowed to settle back into the marshes."] = "我不知道為什麼，濕地裡正在滋生腐爛。沼澤爬行者出現了。牠們是大地上帶病的、發熱的水皰，要讓熱度退去，牠們必須被消滅，讓牠們重新沉回沼澤。",
    ["Think you can match wits with Daryl the Bold, huh? I should think not! Of course, you're more than welcome to try. Here's a challenge that should prove to be above your abilities, so don't feel too bad if you can't face up to it."] = "你以為你能和大膽的達里爾鬥智，是吧？我看不行！當然，歡迎你嘗試。這裡有個超出你能力的挑戰，所以如果面對不了，也別太難過。",
    ["Recently, just before the Troggs surfaced within the site, we had uncovered a large number of strange, carved idols. But we didn't have the chance to study them, for soon after their discovery the Troggs chased us away from the ruins!"] = "最近，就在穴居人出現在遺址裡之前，我們發現了大量奇怪的雕刻神像。但我們沒來得及研究，因為它們被發現後不久，穴居人就把我們從廢墟裡趕了出來！",
    ["Now that the catapults have been burned, find and kill Chieftain Nek'rosh."] = "既然投石車已經被燒毀，去找到並殺死酋長奈克羅什。",
    ["Murlocs are becoming a problem. Larger groups of the fishmen are dropping anchor along the shores of Lake Everstill and fishing up a storm!"] = "魚人正在成為問題。更大的魚人群體正沿著靜水湖岸邊拋錨，大肆捕魚！",
    ["ath, is it? I can tell you're bursting with pride over completing the first test, hm? As I told you before, it's no large feat. You should try your hand at boar hunting."] = "阿斯，是嗎？我看得出你因完成第一個試煉而得意洋洋，嗯？我之前說過，這不算什麼大本事。你該試試獵野豬。",
    ["Me and some other warriors were sent by the Warchief to retrieve an object from Durnholde and to investigate this so-called Syndicate."] = "我和其他幾名戰士被酋長派去從敦霍爾德取回一件東西，並調查這個所謂的辛迪加。",
    ["The pendant? Of course you can have it... Take it! I want no memory of him... just please, please leave in peace..."] = "吊墜？當然可以給你……拿去吧！我不想留下關於他的任何記憶……只求你，只求你平靜地離開……",
    ["To survive, I have to be tricky! I know the recipe for flash bombs."] = "為了生存，我必須狡猾！我知道閃光炸彈的配方。",
    ["He's done it this time! Bad enough that Gelriz's muscling out the moguls who were appointed by the trade princes, now he tries to cut in on the most notorious pirate!"] = "這次他可做過頭了！吉爾里茲排擠商業親王任命的大亨還不夠，現在他又想插手那個最臭名昭著的海盜的生意！",
    ["You have proven yourself time and again, and your resourcefulness seems to rival even that of Kurzen himself. You may be the salvation of our band of rebels...if you can pit yourself against Kurzen and prevail!"] = "你一次又一次地證明了自己，你的機智似乎連庫爾森本人都比不上。如果你能與庫爾森對決並獲勝，你也許就是我們這夥叛軍的救星！",
    ["The Stromgarde Militia has placed bounties on the heads of Lord Falconcrest, and his bodyguard Otto. Falconcrest heads the Syndicate's efforts in the Arathi Highlands, and his death would cause a major disruption in those efforts."] = "斯通納德民兵已為鷹冠勳爵和他的保鑣奧托的人頭懸賞。鷹冠是辛迪加在阿拉希高地行動的負責人，他的死將使這些行動遭受重大破壞。",
    ["You serve my husband well, but he does not know why Hammerfall is under attack."] = "你為我丈夫效力得很好，但他不知道為什麼落錘鎮會遭到攻擊。",
    ["Ambassador Infernus was sent to Angor Fortress by Ragnaros himself to mind the Shadowforge seeking lost artifacts in Uldaman. It has already meant tremendous casualties for our people, but it has obviously grown worse."] = "因菲努斯大使由拉格納羅斯親自派往安戈拉要塞，負責監督暗影熔爐一族在奧達曼搜尋失落的神器。這已經替我們的族人帶來了極大的傷亡，而且情況顯然變得更糟了。",
    ["Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands. When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."] = "勘探者維爾加現在把那塊原始化石保管在他位於濕地的據點裡。當我發現雷魯之石時，我以為它就是解開化石之謎的鑰匙。",
    ["When I struggled with the Forsaken's poisons, I had a vision. I had a vision of the druids in the Dor'danil Barrow Den, poisoned... murdered by the undead!"] = "當我與被遺忘者的毒藥苦苦抗爭時，我看見了一個幻象。我看見多丹尼爾巢穴裡的德魯伊們遭到毒害……被不死族謀殺了！",
    ["We shall rein in the worgen problem, have no worry of that. This evil that your friend introduced to our woods will be contained, and I bear her no ill will for her actions."] = "我們會控制住狼人的問題，不必擔心。你的朋友帶進我們森林的這股邪惡將被遏止，我對她的所作所為並無惡意。",
    ["It makes them go berserk! Bring me 8 idols - I want to study them, and I want them out of Trogg hands!"] = "它會讓牠們變得狂暴！給我帶8個神像來——我想研究它們，也想讓它們遠離穴居人之手！",
    ["Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon."] = "回奧格瑪找貝爾格羅姆，告訴他莫克塔在千針石林把他交代的事辦得很好。也告訴他，我的研究有進展，我希望很快能知道更多。",
    ["It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."] = "花了很長的時間，但我找到里斯了。他躲得很好，以人類來說。奧格隆擔心他在沼澤裡待了這麼久可能瘋了。你跟我來，我們去從他那裡問出答案。",
    ["I am so lost! My wife, Torta, sent me out to fetch dinner and I must have taken a wrong turn somewhere. Would you be so kind as to lead me back to Torta?"] = "我迷路了！我妻子托爾塔叫我出來找晚餐，我一定是在哪裡轉錯了彎。你能不能行行好，帶我回托爾塔身邊？",
    ["The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."] = "你從枯木部落的蜘蛛神身上取得的毒液真是了不起的發現！我只用一滴這東西，就毒死了將近兩打兔子。",
    ["If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere."] = "如果你能行行好，把這件聖物交給我的妻子薇絲蒂亞，我會很感激。她不只是我們社群裡出色的女祭司，也是你能找到的最博學的學者之一。",
    ["Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."] = "埃達娜·憎爪是住在西邊廢墟裡的北泉鷹身人的女王。她是純粹的邪惡；我聽說她的心是水晶做的。",
    ["You dare challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk? Haw! Me crush tiny! You tell me when ready for good beating."] = "你竟敢挑戰大領主莫克莫洛克？哈！我捏碎小東西！你準備好挨揍了再來告訴我。",
    ["Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."] = "聽好了。雖然這四座塔永遠無法被摧毀，但你可以用復仇火炬讓它們燃燒很長一段時間：一團任何元素或力量都無法撲滅的火焰。",
    ["Just one last thing you must do, soldier. I've taken the liberty of putting Gor'tesh's head on a pike. Now all you have to do is take this head to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and stick it into the ground."] = "士兵，你還有最後一件事要做。我擅自把戈爾泰什的頭插在長矛上了。現在你只要把這顆頭帶到恐怖之槌岩的頂端，插進土裡就行了。",
    ["While you have been exploring Un'Goro, I have seen other things that a mighty hunter such as yourself would relish in. One such sight was a huge ape among the other gorillas to the north."] = "在你探索安戈洛的時候，我還看見其他像你這樣強大的獵人會喜歡的東西。其中一個是北邊其他大猩猩之中的一隻巨大猿猴。",
    ["Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area."] = "懸賞：需要一名熟練的戰士，處理棲息在安戈洛火山口的翼手龍所造成的威脅。牠們的數量正在增加，已經成為該地區旅人的禍害。",
    ["I'm going to need more samples. But--and I don't know how to put this--they have to be pure samples. I know, I know. \"What does 'pure' mean, Laris?\" I'm not sure."] = "我還需要更多樣本。但是——我不知道該怎麼說——它們必須是純淨的樣本。我知道，我知道。「『純淨』是什麼意思，拉里斯？」我也不確定。",
    ["The blade the Silver Hand carried against the Scourge, and the one Tirion Fordring's order was built around. Corrupted when Renault Mograine used it on his own father, Alexandros, in the Scarlet Monastery."] = "銀色之手用來對抗天災軍團的利刃，也是提里奧·弗丁的騎士團賴以建立的那一把。當雷納德·莫格萊尼在血色修道院用它對付自己的父親亞力山卓斯時，它被腐化了。",
    ["You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"] = "你看起來很能幹。也許你想賺點錢？科克和我創辦這支商隊就是為了大賺一筆；可我們萬萬沒想到賺錢要冒這麼多危險！",
    ["Bibbly thinks he is the only goblin in Desolace who knows how to make money. Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me."] = "比布利以為他是淒涼之地唯一懂得賺錢的地精。哼，唯一敢在這一帶旅行的商隊可是靠我的。",
    ["While I do possess much knowledge about the owlbeasts you defeated in Winterspring, I am not very learned on the subject of the magics they wield."] = "雖然我確實很了解你在冬泉谷擊敗的梟獸，但對於牠們所運用的魔法卻不太精通。",
    ["Mirah Chandler's song, given for finishing a chain of favours in the Barrens -- the reward players remember long after they forget the errands."] = "米拉·錢德勒的歌，完成貧瘠之地一連串人情任務後獲得的獎勵——玩家在忘記那些跑腿任務很久之後，依然記得它。",
    ["Kill me. Before it's too late. I am Hameya. While traveling to Zul'Mashar, my brethren and I ate some bad meat... and we changed. We are infected."] = "殺了我。趁還來得及。我是哈梅亞。前往祖瑪沙爾的途中，我和兄弟們吃了壞掉的肉……然後我們變了。我們被感染了。",
    ["The black dragonflight's overseer in Lower Blackrock Spire, keeping the orcs there in line on Nefarian's behalf."] = "黑龍軍團在黑石塔下層的監工，代替奈法利安管束那裡的獸人。",
    ["Demetria is chief advisor to the Grand Crusader. She is called the Oracle due to her 'otherworldly' senses. She has successfully assisted the Crusade in several of their victories against the Scourge."] = "迪米特莉亞是大十字軍的首席顧問。因為她「超凡脫俗」的感知，人們稱她為神諭者。她曾成功協助十字軍贏得數場對抗天災軍團的勝利。",
    ["you are a hunter worthy of our company. From the battlefields of Lordaeron to the deepest jungle, I have rarely witnessed such prowess with weaponry as you have demonstrated."] = "你是一名值得與我們為伍的獵人。從洛丹倫的戰場到最深的叢林，我很少見過有人像你一樣展現出如此精湛的武器技藝。",
    ["One of Onyxia's own teeth, taken after she was finally dragged out of Stormwind's court and killed in her lair."] = "奧妮克希亞自己的牙齒之一，是在她終於被拖出暴風城王廷並在巢穴中被殺死之後取得的。",
    ["A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."] = "拉格納羅斯的一名副官，在火誓者的簇擁下作戰，每當其中一個倒下，他就會變得更強。",
    ["I'm going to have to do something about the giants if I stay out here! They're certainly not good for business, now are they?"] = "如果我留在這裡，就得對那些巨人想點辦法了！牠們當然對生意沒好處，不是嗎？",
    ["Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job."] = "你瞧，每次老漢索想歇口氣，回顧一下自己的人生，當權者就會再派他一份差事。",
    ["One of Nefarian's three guardian drakes, holding the suspended walkways above the lair floor."] = "奈法利安三頭守衛龍之一，把守著巢穴地面上方懸空的步道。",
    ["We Zandalar prize what we wear as a symbol of accomplishment."] = "我們贊達拉人把所穿戴的東西視為成就的象徵。",
    ["You must master both to have any chance of success in Zul'Gurub... and any chance of being like the Zandalar predators."] = "想要在祖爾格拉布成功，你必須精通兩者……也才有機會成為像贊達拉掠食者那樣的人。",
    ["In the dark times after the fall of the Gurubashi Empire, Zandalar predators used their prowess to provide sustenance for the tribe."] = "在古拉巴什帝國殞落後的黑暗時代，贊達拉的掠食者運用他們的本領為部族提供糧食。",
    ["To Whom It May Concern: If you're reading this, I'm either dead or soon to be dead. It's hard to say. Most of the crew is dead anyhow. Found information about a Titan."] = "致相關人士：如果你正在讀這封信，那我不是已經死了，就是快死了。很難說。反正大部分船員都死了。發現了一些關於泰坦的資訊。",
    ["We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."] = "我們並沒有袖手旁觀千年。我們看著這些野獸在耗盡價值後自相吞食。我們聽著牠們密謀策劃，要摧毀我們的世界。",
    ["Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."] = "其拉的魔法強大而古老。最強大的其拉所使用的物品擁有如此威力，連巨龍也會為之遲疑。",
    ["Bring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!"] = "把其拉最高首領所佩戴的束縛帶給我，我會把它們製成一副比奈法利安本人的雙翼還要可怕的肩甲！",
    ["Bring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power."] = "把他的皮膚樣本和其他次要材料帶給我，我會為你打造一件擁有強大力量的護腿。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要讓你持續有興趣拯救我這條命，就該給你一份獎賞。把一條普通的腰帶和一雙你想要升級的手套帶給我。",
    ["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."] = "我發現了地穴惡魔甲殼的用途。把碎片與一些在納克薩瑪斯遺失的遭褻瀆的魔法護甲結合起來，我能製成一套極其輕盈又極其致命的護甲。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icy Scale breastplate."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作冰鱗胸甲了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icy Scale bracers."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作冰鱗護腕了。",
    ["Stormwind has abandoned us. A foul wind of depravity rustles through the plains of Westfall. This was my homeland and I will not turn my back on the citizens who choose to remain here."] = "暴風城拋棄了我們。一陣墮落的惡風在西部荒野的平原上沙沙作響。這是我的故鄉，我不會背棄選擇留在這裡的市民。",
    ["The Defias gang in Northshire wears burlap masks, but the Defias in Elwynn wear linen which I can use to make fine linen goods."] = "北郡的迪菲亞幫派戴麻布面具，但艾爾文的迪菲亞戴亞麻面具，我可以用它來製作上好的亞麻製品。",
    ["If the \"Collector\" is taking gold from our mines then he's stealing from the kingdom! Bring the Collector to justice, and bring me the ring mentioned in the pickup schedule you gave me."] = "如果「收藏者」正從我們的礦坑裡拿走黃金，那他就是在偷竊王國的財產！把收藏者繩之以法，再把你交給我的收取時程表裡提到的戒指帶給我。",
    ["Help me make some Westfall Stew! Come back with the following ingredients: 3 Stringy Vulture Meat 3 Goretusk Snouts 3 Murloc Eyes 3 Okra"] = "幫我做些西部荒野燉菜！帶著以下材料回來：3份堅韌的禿鷹肉、3個血牙豬鼻、3隻魚人眼睛、3個秋葵。",
    ["Gnolls, brutish creatures with no decent business in these lands, have been seen along the borders of Elwynn Forest. A large pack of them, many more than we can handle alone, have infested the woods south of the guard tower yonder."] = "有人在艾爾文森林邊境看到了豺狼人，這些粗野的傢伙在這片土地上沒有正經事。一大群豺狼人，遠比我們自己應付得來的多，已經盤據了那邊哨塔以南的樹林。",
    ["I'm behind on my report, and could use your help. I just managed to find where the trolls are holed up, but I saw so many trolls, I was afraid to go in."] = "我的報告落後了，需要你的幫忙。我剛找到食人妖的藏身處，但我看到太多食人妖了，不敢進去。",
    ["You've shown your potential to the Forsaken under normal circumstances - now let's see you under pressure. The Rattlecage skeletons, more mindless minions of the Lich King, are a tougher foe than the zombies you have faced thus far."] = "你已經在正常情況下向被遺忘者展現了你的潛力——現在讓我們看看你在壓力下的表現。嘎嘎響的骷髏，是巫妖王更沒腦袋的爪牙，比你到目前為止遇過的殭屍更難對付。",
    ["We Forsaken are at war with the Lich King's army of the Scourge: necromantically raised armies of the undead, foul beasts of the north, and tormented spectres."] = "我們被遺忘者正與巫妖王的天災軍團交戰：以死靈法術復活的不死大軍、北方的邪惡野獸，以及飽受折磨的幽魂。",
    ["Reports from my superiors in Brill indicate that an agent of the Scarlet Crusade was dispatched from the Scarlet Monastery and sent here to Deathknell."] = "我在布瑞爾的上級回報說，一名血色十字軍的探員從血色修道院被派出，並被派到了這裡的喪鐘鎮。",
    ["While you were out gathering, I uncovered some old text in one of my tomes that indicates that an ancient plague wiped out thousands of innocent victims."] = "你外出採集的時候，我在一本典籍裡發現了一段古老的文字，說明一場遠古瘟疫奪走了數千名無辜者的性命。",
    ["The Scourge are trying to form a base at the Agamand Mills. If they do, then they can stage further attacks within Tirisfal. The orders have been given."] = "天災軍團正試圖在阿加曼德磨坊建立基地。如果他們成功了，就能從那裡對提里斯法發動更多攻擊。命令已經下達。",
    ["The Stormwind Army has placed a bounty on murloc lurkers and foragers in Elwynn. Slaughter them and bring me their torn murloc fins, and the Stormwind Army will reward you well."] = "暴風城軍隊懸賞艾爾文的潛伏魚人和採集魚人。殺掉牠們，把牠們撕裂的魚人鰭帶給我，暴風城軍隊會重重獎賞你。",
    ["I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here... A group that calls itself the Burning Blade has a coven here in the Valley of Trials."] = "我被派到山谷來為你引路，但我發現這裡有一股日益增長的汙染……一個自稱燃刃軍團的團體在試煉谷建立了巢穴。",
    ["The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."] = "劍齒虎的毛皮是獨特的灰色，與周圍的森林融為一體。當她躺在那裡時，你看得出她傷得很重，背上和肚子上有深深的撕裂傷。",
    ["There is a malevolence growing in the timberlings. We are trying to find the source, but until we do...in order to keep Teldrassil safe we must cut down the timberlings who are beyond help."] = "小樹人之中正滋生著一種惡意。我們正試圖找出源頭，但在找到之前……為了確保泰達希爾的安全，我們必須砍倒那些已經無藥可救的小樹人。",
    ["I trust the Valley of Trials will teach you much, young. I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here..."] = "我相信試煉谷會教你很多東西，年輕人。我被派到山谷來為你引路，但我發現這裡有一股日益增長的汙染……",
    ["I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season. Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it! But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker."] = "我準備了一個月份的肉乾，醃好並鎖起來過冬。我鎖著，就是不讓熊吃到！可是我外出獵鹿的時候，那頭野獸，老冰鬚，把整個肉櫃都拖走了。",
    ["Teebu's blade sets things on fire for reasons no one has ever explained. It is famous for being almost useless and deeply desirable at the same time."] = "提布的劍會因為從來沒有人解釋過的原因點燃東西。它既幾乎毫無用處，又令人極度渴望，因而聞名。",
    ["By order of High Executor Darthalia, the human known as Baron Vardus is wanted for crimes against the Forsaken. Vardus is known to be a high-ranking member of the organization known as the Syndicate."] = "奉高階執行者達薩莉亞之命，人類瓦達斯男爵因對被遺忘者犯下的罪行而遭到通緝。據悉瓦達斯是辛迪加組織的高階成員。",
    ["Our initial scouting reports of Silverpine show the rot hides have a base at an old farm to the north, the Dead Fields."] = "我們對銀松森林的初步偵察報告顯示，腐皮獸人在北邊的一座舊農場，枯萎之地，設有一處據點。",
    ["You looking fer work? I might have some if you're up for a little challenge. I got a friend named Groy who makes a killing selling what the naga call akiris reed: it's some kind of valuable ocean reed."] = "你在找工作嗎？如果你願意接受一點小挑戰，我可能有。我有個朋友叫格羅伊，靠賣納迦所說的阿奇里斯蘆葦賺了不少錢：那是某種珍貴的海洋蘆葦。",
    ["But the power harnessed in these goggles will allow you to locate them easily. A little gnomish ingenuity goes a long way!"] = "但這副護目鏡所蘊含的力量能讓你輕易找到它們。一點地精的巧思就能派上大用場！",
    ["Now that you've had a taste of the Crushridge ogres, I want you to really bloody their noses... Go into the Ruins of Alterac and seek out the Crushridge Warmongers."] = "既然你已經嚐過碎嶺食人魔的滋味，我想要你真正地打他們的鼻子……前往奧特蘭克廢墟，找到碎嶺好戰者。",
    ["I have received reports that a group of undead are holing up to prepare for an attack against us. Armed with this information, we can turn the tables and attack them first, nipping their little plan in the bud."] = "我收到報告，一群不死族正躲在某處準備對我們發動攻擊。有了這份情報，我們可以扭轉局面，搶先攻擊他們，把他們的小計畫扼殺在萌芽階段。",
    ["Travelers keep asking me about the Stonetalon Mountains. It seems to be a popular place for adventure--it doesn't matter if you're seeking wyvern, elementals, or you have business with the Venture Co."] = "旅人們不停地問我關於石爪山脈的事。那似乎是個熱門的冒險地——不管你是要找飛龍、元素生物，還是和風險投資公司有生意往來。",
    ["Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons."] = "銦錠具有驚人的耐熱性！我確信它能用在菲茲爾的活塞上。",
    ["You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."] = "你做得很好。你通過了我的試煉，以及我之前的試煉。回到千針石林的多恩那裡去。",
    ["Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."] = "我已精疲力竭。需要你的協助！很久以前，這裡是艾露恩的一座偉大神殿。但不幸導致了毀滅，一位上古之神的腐化從地底滲出，玷汙了神聖的月亮井。",
    ["We mages do more than just waggle our fingers and make pretty sparks! We control magic, the base fabric of our world! And that takes great care, and resolve."] = "我們法師做的可不只是揮揮手指、變出漂亮的火花！我們掌控魔法，我們世界的基礎織網！這需要極大的謹慎和決心。",
    ["This world has been victim to massive mystic struggles, which tore magic currents from once stable channels. We struggle to determine the effects these changes have caused, and some of us fear the worst!"] = "這個世界曾是巨大神祕鬥爭的受害者，這些鬥爭把魔法洪流從曾經穩定的通道中扯了出來。我們努力判斷這些變化造成了什麼影響，我們當中有些人擔心最糟的情況！",
    ["I'll go make the wands now."] = "我現在就去做魔杖。",
    ["Gnomeregan has fallen under the control of those dastardly troggs! The situation is grave but perhaps you can help. Deep in the Deadmines is a functional goblin shredder."] = "諾姆瑞根已經落入那些卑鄙的穴居人的掌控之中！情況嚴重，但也許你能幫上忙。在死亡礦坑深處有一台能用的地精伐木機。",
    ["Naralex had a noble goal. Our great leader aspired to enter the Emerald Dream and help regrow these harsh lands back into the lush forest it once was."] = "納拉雷克斯有一個崇高的目標。我們偉大的領袖渴望進入翡翠夢境，協助這些荒蕪的土地重新長回曾經的茂密森林。",
    ["The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade."] = "就在神器從巨石碑上被取下的那一刻，你感覺到均衡之杖中的能量開始消退。",
    ["Oh, you know what? That reminds me. You wanna finish up a little job I took up while I was in Tanaris? It's easy... Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan was lookin' for some stuff found here in Searing Gorge and a few other places."] = "喔，你知道嗎？這讓我想起一件事。你想不想完成我在塔納利斯時接下的一件小差事？很簡單……加基森的克林克爾·古德斯提爾在找一些這裡灼熱峽谷和其他幾個地方出產的東西。",
    ["Off the coast of Darkshore to our north are two wrecked ships - the Silver Dawning and the Mist Veil. Some time ago, both ships ran afoul of the blasted murlocs as they sailed across the vast sea into Auberdine."] = "在我們北邊的黑海岸外有兩艘失事的船——銀色黎明號和迷霧面紗號。不久前，兩艘船在橫越浩瀚大海駛往奧伯丁時，都遇上了該死的魚人。",
    ["A human lord who traded his life for undeath and became a lich in Scholomance. Killing him takes a blade specifically made to sever the bargain."] = "一位以生命換取不死之身、在通靈學院成為巫妖的人類領主。要殺死他，需要一把專門為斬斷這場交易而打造的刀刃。",
    ["Rackmore's log tells of how his ship was sailing for Feathermoon Stronghold when it was attacked by seafaring creatures."] = "拉克摩爾的日誌描述了他的船駛向羽月要塞時遭到海洋生物攻擊的經過。",
    ["The Vilebranch fight with supernatural ferocity. This is due to the foul magical weavings of the Vile Priestess Hexx. Throughout Jintha'alor you will find dark vessels of tainted blood."] = "邪枝部族以超自然的凶猛作戰。這是因為邪惡的女祭司赫克絲那骯髒的魔法編織。在整個金薩阿羅，你會發現盛著受汙染之血的黑色容器。",
    ["How can one truly hope to win against a foe that is not even really there? We Zandalar know the power of this, and as such illusionists hold a honored place within the tribe."] = "人要怎麼真正期望擊敗一個根本不在那裡的敵人？我們贊達拉人深知其中的力量，因此幻術師在部族中占有受人尊敬的地位。",
    ["For you to know the way of our illusionists, go to Zul'Gurub and bring back to me selected Paragons of Power. For this, I will give you arm wraps our illusionists use to weave their spells."] = "想要了解我們幻術師的方式，就前往祖爾格拉布，把挑選出的力量典範帶給我。作為回報，我會給你我們的幻術師編織法術時所用的護腕。",
    ["Legend states that their ancient robes never looked the same twice. I will give you an illusionist's robe..."] = "傳說他們古老的長袍從來沒有兩次看起來一樣。我會給你一件幻術師的長袍……",
    ["There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz. Years ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole."] = "在阿塔哈卡沉沒的神廟深處，有一頭名叫莫爾法茲的綠龍。幾年前，他在一次大膽的伏擊中壓制了我，把我的學徒整個吞了下去。",
    ["I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy. I shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course."] = "我可以替你做一件防護用品，對抗我們的敵人時會有幫助。我需要一件其拉披風，當然我會替你調整尺寸。",
    ["Well met. I've something that might interest you. I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality."] = "幸會。我有樣東西也許你會有興趣。我擁有一套很像你們這個職業的人所穿的護甲，但品質高出許多。",
    ["While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire."] = "雖然大多數的書裡——說白了——都是廢話，但也有一些寶貝。其中一本典籍記載了一套適合大法師的護甲的製作方法：霜火。",
    ["Now that my crop is saved, take this Grape Manifest to Brother Neals. He manages the store of food and drink in Northshire, and I'm sure he'll be delighted to hear that he has fresh grapes."] = "既然我的莊稼保住了，把這份葡萄清單帶給尼爾斯兄弟吧。他負責管理北郡的食物和飲料庫存，我相信他聽到有新鮮葡萄一定會很高興。",
    ["My friend and fellow Siege Engine pilot, Mori Hildelve, is lost in the hills."] = "我的朋友兼攻城器械駕駛員夥伴，莫里·希爾德爾夫，在山裡迷路了。",
    ["After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."] = "仔細研究地圖後，你發現你找到的是刺背酋長對納拉其營地進行長期圍攻的計畫。",
    ["My grandfather told me stories about his battles with a strider named Mazzranache. He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite."] = "我祖父跟我講過他和一隻名叫馬茲拉納奇的陸行鳥戰鬥的故事。他告訴我牠那惡魔般的紅眼睛、剃刀般銳利的利爪和有毒的毒牙。",
    ["Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor. It will let us communicate... and I have much to tell him."] = "把這顆虛空寶石帶給我的老戰友貝索爾。它能讓我們彼此交談……而我有很多話要對他說。",
    ["you are a with proven interest in the security of Northshire. You are now tasked with the protection of the surrounding Elwynn Forest."] = "你是個對北郡安全有目共睹關切的人。你現在受命保護周圍的艾爾文森林。",
    ["He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "他挫敗了所有想抓住他的企圖。暴風城軍隊為這隻豺狼人懸賞了一大筆賞金。",
    ["Many a hunter is attracted to Loch Modan to hunt our famous crocs. There are always merchants who seek out crocolisk skins for clothing items or armor, and there are also some who enjoy the taste of their meat."] = "許多獵人被吸引到洛克莫丹來獵捕我們著名的鱷魚。總有商人在尋找鱷魚皮用來做衣物或護甲，也有些人喜歡牠們的肉味。",
    ["Many of my soldiers died in the battle of Dun Modr. My own brother perished when the West Bridge over the Thandol Span was destroyed. Aye, the Dark Iron dwarves are a devilish breed."] = "我的許多士兵死在丹莫德之戰中。我自己的兄弟在桑多爾跨度上的西橋被毀時喪生。是啊，黑鐵矮人是一個惡魔般的種族。",
    ["Hail. Perhaps you've seen those spiders that have taken over the western border? The eight-legged menaces are too much for us to handle, and the Commander hasn't enough manpower to spare so far from Darkshire."] = "你好。也許你看到了占據西邊邊界的那些蜘蛛？這些八隻腳的禍害我們應付不來，而指揮官在離夜色鎮這麼遠的地方也抽不出足夠的人手。",
    ["My former mentor in the Stormwind city guard sent a message to me that Alliance High Command is becoming concerned with the threat posed by the naga."] = "我在暴風城城市衛隊的前導師捎信給我，說聯盟最高指揮部越來越擔心納迦所構成的威脅。",
    ["But complications have arisen. A local band of ogres has occupied the Mizjah Ruins to the southeast of Grom'gol."] = "但出現了麻煩。當地的一群食人魔占據了格羅姆高東南方的米茲加廢墟。",
    ["I put my faith in you and anyone you can muster to help free me. The great Skymane King Mukla is my captor. He commands the beasts of this island, and they keep me here against my will with the aid of this chain."] = "我把希望寄託在你和你能召集的所有人身上，幫助我重獲自由。偉大的天鬃之王穆克拉是囚禁我的人。他指揮著這座島上的野獸，牠們藉著這條鎖鏈違背我的意願把我關在這裡。",
    ["Curses! That swab Maury put a lock on his foot, and I can't open it! His loot's inside the foot, and that's what he owes me! We need to find the key to open the lock."] = "可惡！那個蠢蛋莫里在他的腳上上了鎖，我打不開！他的戰利品就在那隻腳裡，那是他欠我的！我們得找到打開鎖的鑰匙。",
    ["Blast the nerve of Firallon! He couldn't sail a skiff through Crystal Lake let alone lead an entire fleet against us. The Bloodsail Buccaneers will pay for their carelessness."] = "去他的菲拉隆的膽子！他連一艘小艇都開不過水晶湖，更別說率領整支艦隊來對付我們了。血帆海盜會為他們的疏忽付出代價。",
    ["The light slowly fades, the sword Trol'kalar, held within a stone sheath has been released."] = "光芒漸漸消退，封在石鞘中的劍特羅爾卡拉已被釋放。",
    ["O'Breen led the ships into the cove. We were certain this is where the treasure could be found. The Harbinger docked safely but as the Maiden's Folly and Spirit of Silverpine approached the tides began to lower."] = "奧布林把船隊帶進了海灣。我們確信寶藏就在這裡。使者號安全靠岸，但當少女之愚號和銀松之魂號靠近時，潮水開始下降。",
    ["The treasure has been on the sea floor so long that the gems have calcified into thick stone. But the power harnessed in these goggles will allow you to locate them easily."] = "寶藏在海底沉沒太久，寶石都已鈣化成厚厚的石頭。但這副護目鏡所蘊含的力量能讓你輕易找到它們。",
    ["It's going to be tough going here if I can't manage to scrounge up some materials to construct some defenses and other necessities. I've noticed that the ogres in the area seem to be well equipped with scrap metal."] = "如果我找不到材料來建造一些防禦工事和其他必需品，這裡的日子會很難熬。我注意到這一帶的食人魔似乎配備了大量廢金屬。",
    ["The Syndicate in Stromgarde do battle with our contingent of militia there."] = "斯通納德的辛迪加正與我們在那裡的民兵分隊交戰。",
    ["I guess I'd better think about getting out of here, also. It won't take long for word of what happened here to spread to the higher ups, and I'm sure they wouldn't take too kindly to meeting me again."] = "我想我也最好考慮離開這裡了。這裡發生的事傳到高層不會花多久時間，我相信他們不會樂意再見到我。",
    ["The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."] = "血怒部族已被壓制。但如果不採取行動，他們很快就會重新集結。貧瘠之地的遙遠南方有一片名叫千針石林的土地。",
    ["Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."] = "德爾格倫請我替他送消息和補給給奧伯丁的哨兵星風，但我不願獨自前往。",
    ["Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."] = "雖然我對這位阿茲瑞托克勳爵一無所知，但我同意莫林的看法，必須阻止他；尤其是如果他想藉此影響燃刃軍團以達成他的目的。",
    ["Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."] = "請幫幫我！這些生物要吃了我！幫我離開這裡，我會給你一件珍寶！它在斯通納德以北沼澤裡我的營地中，但鎖在一只保險箱裡，只有我知道的竅門才能打開。",
    ["Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all."] = "我們何不去鍛造爐那邊開始做這件事呢？我已經為你的到來準備了一段時間，所以不會花很久。",
    ["Please, return to Duthorian and let him know that I'm safe for now. I have you and the Church to thank for that. He'll send word to Ironforge to let my Jordan know that he has nothing to fear."] = "請回到杜索利安那裡，告訴他我暫時安全了。這要感謝你和教會。他會送消息到鐵爐堡，讓我的喬丹知道他沒什麼好擔心的。",
    ["Thanks again for your help. Here's a bottle of Steamwheedle bilge rum. Take it to MacKinley and he can finally put to rest his crazy beliefs about Booty Bay booze."] = "再次感謝你的幫忙。這是一瓶熱砂港艙底蘭姆酒。把它帶給麥金利，他終於可以放棄他關於藏寶海灣酒的瘋狂想法了。",
    ["A plain plate glove that became famous for its random enchants -- the of Strength roll is a 7.9% chance and was worth chasing over guaranteed epics for years."] = "一只樸素的板甲手套，因隨機附魔而聞名——力量後綴的出現機率是7.9%，多年來比保底的史詩裝備更值得追逐。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-09/HL to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "地精的聲音再次從機器人裡劈啪傳出：「我需要把OOX-09/HL移到一個開闊安全的地方，這樣它才能開始漫長的起飛程序。",
    ["With the battle plans of the gnolls discovered, all that now remains is to bring the plans back to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache. Perhaps he or someone there can make further sense of what the gnolls are up to."] = "既然已經發現了豺狼人的作戰計畫，剩下的就是把計畫帶回莫沙徹營地的哈多肯·迅行者那裡。也許他或那裡的某個人能進一步弄清豺狼人在打什麼主意。",
    ["Whilst that craven fool, Mok'Morokk, wallows in power and Tharg wrestles the demons of sorrow and vengeance and vies for leadership of the clan, I seem to be the only one concerned with identifying the source of aggression on our old home."] = "當那個懦弱的蠢蛋莫克莫洛克沉浸在權力裡，塔爾格正與悲傷和復仇的惡魔搏鬥並爭奪氏族的領導權時，似乎只有我一個人在關心查明對我們舊家園發動攻擊的根源。",
    ["What is left of a green dragon who went into the Sunken Temple after the Nightmare and did not come out himself."] = "一頭進入沉沒的神廟追擊夢魘、卻未能自己出來的綠龍所剩下的東西。",
    ["I'll tell you what. If you give me those unfired gauntlets, I will teach you how to make a set all your own."] = "我告訴你吧。如果你把那些未燒製的護手給我，我就教你如何製作一套完全屬於你自己的。",
    ["For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?"] = "這麼久以來，我一直是大十字軍的傀儡。為什麼要對抗血色十字軍變成的樣子？",
    ["A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."] = "一頭深火之中的熔核犬，被當作看守獸，由拉格納羅斯的副官們餵養。",
    ["Everything was going well, but a large gust of wind blew through the camp and scattered the pages everywhere! I was able to gather most of the pages but many are still strewn about the jungle."] = "一切都很順利，可是一陣大風吹過營地，把書頁吹得到處都是！我收集了大部分書頁，但仍有許多散落在叢林裡。",
    ["Unfortunately, I can't dish out the beats like I used to, due to this here fat finger problem. Ye see, the climate out here combined with the lack o' air pressure makes me fingers expand."] = "不幸的是，由於這手指太粗的問題，我沒辦法再像以前那樣大打出手了。你看，這裡的氣候加上氣壓低，讓我的手指膨脹。",
    ["Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."] = "奈法利安的最佳成果：一頭雙頭的彩色恐怖巨龍，同時帶著每個龍群的吐息。",
    ["They imbue their breastplates with powerful mojo. If their beliefs falter in the face of the enemy, their breastplate will not."] = "他們為胸甲灌注強大的魔力。如果他們的信念在敵人面前動搖，他們的胸甲卻不會。",
    ["Your beliefs are alien to us, heathen. Ancient Zandalar were once branded as heretics."] = "你們的信仰對我們來說是陌生的，異教徒。古代贊達拉人曾被烙上異端的印記。",
    ["Heathens have a place in the tribe. Heathens are freethinkers of Zandalar."] = "異教徒在部族中有一席之地。異教徒是贊達拉的自由思想者。",
    ["One of Hakkar's high priests, who returns to his feet twice before he stays down."] = "哈卡的一位大祭司，會兩度站起來才會倒下不動。",
    ["A green dragon of Ysera's flight, turned by the Nightmare and hunted across Feralas ever since."] = "伊瑟拉一族的一頭綠龍，被夢魘扭曲，此後一直在菲拉斯被追獵。",
    ["The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you."] = "裝飾其拉神像的寶石會很有用，因為它們的品質更優。把戒指和神像帶給我，我會為你製作一枚強力戒指。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要讓你持續有興趣拯救我這條命，就該給你一份獎賞。把你想要升級的腰帶和護手帶給我。",
    ["You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas."] = "你會在納克薩瑪斯領主的屍體上找到我們陣亡英雄的遺物。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icy Scale gauntlets."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作冰鱗護手了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icebane breastplate."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作冰霜之殤胸甲了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icebane gauntlets."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作冰霜之殤護手了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icebane bracers."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩（願他安息），我現在能製作冰霜之殤護腕了。",
    ["This will at least protect her from harm longer if she finds trouble. Return to me here after you've done your duty to Elune."] = "如果她遇上麻煩，這至少能讓她更久地免於傷害。你完成對艾露恩的職責之後，回到這裡來找我。",
    ["Normally I put forth a small challenge to followers of the Light to test their skill."] = "通常我會給光明的追隨者出一個小小的挑戰，來檢驗他們的技藝。",
    ["You be ready for your first test. South of Razor Hill, just outta town, one of our grunts be hurt fightin' off some o' Proudmoore's old troops."] = "準備好迎接你的第一個試煉吧。剃刀嶺以南，剛出鎮子，我們的一個兵在抵禦普勞德摩爾舊部時受了傷。",
    ["Our power comes from darkness and shadow, but that is not your only role. You have acknowledged that there is merit in knowing the healing arts."] = "我們的力量來自黑暗與陰影，但那並不是你唯一的角色。你已經承認，了解治療之術是有價值的。",
    ["But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."] = "但要吹響號角，你需要一個吹嘴。要取得吹嘴，就去殺瑪拉頓的半人馬。",
    ["You secure the sealed testing kit for the journey back to the Undercity. Apothecary Zinge waits for you and the sealed field testing kit there."] = "你把密封的測試工具組收好，準備返回幽暗城。藥劑師辛格正在那裡等著你和這個密封的野外測試工具組。",
    ["The confessors of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive mantle, marking them as the preservers of the tribe."] = "贊達拉的懺悔者都披著獨特的披肩，標示他們是部族的守護者。",
    ["Shortly after the fall of the Gurubashi, we Zandalar almost succumbed to a final defeat from evil within our own tribe."] = "古拉巴什殞落不久後，我們贊達拉人差點敗給來自我們自己部族內部的邪惡。",
    ["We Zandalar invest power in those who speak with the authority of divinity."] = "我們贊達拉人把力量賦予那些以神性的權威說話的人。",
    ["The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity. Bring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith."] = "那些在戰場上嚥下最後一口氣的可憐靈魂——被剝奪了一切，包括尊嚴。把逝者遭褻瀆的遺骸連同淨化用的材料帶給我，你就會知曉信仰。",
    ["I came to Shadowglen to observe the webwood spiders that dwell in the Shadowthread Cave."] = "我來到影踪谷，是為了觀察棲息在影絲洞穴裡的網木蜘蛛。",
    ["I'll leave it to you to get Tazan's satchel open, and return to me with its contents. The locking mechanism is complex, so it would probably be easiest if you obtained the key."] = "塔贊的背包就交給你去打開了，把裡面的東西帶回來給我。鎖的結構很複雜，所以拿到鑰匙大概是最省事的辦法。",
    ["The prized tunic of the Zandalar madcap is no exception, exuding the raw power of chaos and madness that they are able to channel."] = "贊達拉瘋子那件珍貴的外衣也不例外，散發著他們所能引導的混亂與瘋狂的原始力量。",
    ["One of Zandalar's legendary madcaps was Khar'vaxal the Cracked."] = "贊達拉傳說中的瘋子之一，是「瘋癲者」卡爾瓦克薩。",
    ["The madcaps of Zandalar are similar to rogues, but above all else they embrace madness..."] = "贊達拉的瘋子和盜賊有些相似，但他們最重要的是擁抱瘋狂……",
    ["The Soulflayer, a blood god the Atal'ai priests summoned into Zul'Gurub. He feeds on the blood of his own worshippers, which is the part they had not planned for."] = "靈魂掠奪者是阿塔萊祭司召喚到祖爾格拉布的血神。他以自己信徒的鮮血為食，而這是他們沒有料到的。",
    ["The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon. Bring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you."] = "最強大的其拉所使用的物品擁有如此威力，連巨龍也會為之遲疑。把其拉的統御束縛和其他次要材料帶給我，我會為你製作一雙強力的靴子。",
    ["If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials."] = "如果你想讓白骨之鐮被製造出來，就得由你來提供材料。",
    ["Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance. He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped!"] = "死亡騎士達基瑞爾統治著通靈學院的大藏骨堂。他威脅要扭曲靈魂世界來為他所用，必須阻止他！",
    ["The augurs of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive chest piece called a hauberk."] = "贊達拉的占卜師都穿著一種獨特的胸甲，叫做鎖甲。",
    ["Bring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do it and I'll give ya a belt that our augurs use - one with powerful mojo inside it!"] = "把祖爾格拉布裡的力量典範當作祭品帶給我，向我們證明你的價值。做到了，我就給你一條我們占卜師用的腰帶——裡面有強大的魔力！",
    ["They ain't a witch doctor; they spend their time castin' bones or readin' the leaves for insight - not hexin' people. As a shaman, you already know somethin' about the power of augury; we Zandalar prize the insight they give to the tribe."] = "他們不是巫醫；他們把時間花在擲骨頭或讀葉子來獲得洞察，而不是對人下咒。身為薩滿，你已經對占卜的力量有所了解；我們贊達拉人珍視他們帶給部族的洞察。",
    ["Hail! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this."] = "你好！從你的舉止我就看得出，你在這個世界上見過很多、做過很多。不過我敢打賭，你沒見過這樣的護甲。",
    ["Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together."] = "瓦爾薩拉克的靈魂被封存在這個護身符裡。出於貪婪，我們愚蠢地把它分成了三部分，卻不知道等待我們的詛咒。阻止瓦爾薩拉克法術的唯一辦法，就是把護身符重新拼合起來。",
    ["A truly amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past."] = "真是個了不起的故事！我向你致謝，我向你保證，所有相關的人也都會由衷感謝你。多虧了你的努力，我們擺脫了過去的錯誤。",
    ["You've proven to be a very reliable individual. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance."] = "你已證明自己是個非常可靠的人。雖然我相信你會幫我度過這個難關，但依你的表現給予獎賞才是明智之舉。",
    ["For now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets."] = "現在我先把你的腰帶和護手換掉。",
    ["Bring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don."] = "把倒下之人的遺骸連同淨化材料帶給我，碎地者就是你的了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial gloves."] = "多虧了你和歐瑪里恩，願他安息，我現在能製作冰川手套了。",
    ["I hear Lord Wishock enjoyed his beverage. You have served us well. The Warlocks of Stormwind will be able to practice our ways without disturbance, thanks to you."] = "我聽說維休克勳爵很喜歡他的飲料。你為我們效力良多。多虧了你，暴風城的術士們將能不受打擾地修行我們的道路。",
    ["Even fragmented, they still possess the powers of the demons trapped inside. The orb of Soran'ruk was broken into two pieces, one was further broken to be used by the acolytes of the Twilight's Hammer in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "即使碎裂了，它們仍然擁有被困在裡面的惡魔的力量。索蘭魯克之球被分成了兩塊，其中一塊又被進一步打碎，供黑暗深淵裡的暮光之錘侍僧使用。",
    ["I will put the robe together for you now. It will take but a few moments. Do not go far."] = "我現在就為你把長袍拼起來。只需要一會兒，別走遠了。",
    ["I will get started immediately on crafting your orb and infusing your new demon into it. When done, you will have the choice of having it in the form of a staff or orb."] = "我會立刻開始製作你的法球，並把你的新惡魔灌注進去。完成後，你可以選擇把它做成法杖或法球的形態。",
    ["I am the only survivor from our caravan attack by the centaur! A rare yet mighty panther is guarding my best gizmo, which is around his neck."] = "我是我們商隊遭半人馬襲擊後唯一的倖存者！一頭稀有但強大的獵豹守著我最好的小玩意兒，就掛在牠的脖子上。",
    ["The prison is ready. Now for the most difficult portion of this task. You must find and capture a Doomguard Commander within the Tainted Scar using this crystal prison."] = "監牢已經準備好了。現在是這項任務最困難的部分。你必須使用這個水晶監牢，在汙染之痕裡找到並捕獲一名末日守衛指揮官。",
    ["Kroshius lays in a heap to the northeast, in the Shatter Scar Vale. Take this Fel fire and use it on his remains. The fire should reanimate the fallen infernal."] = "克羅休斯癱倒在東北方的碎痕谷裡。拿著這團魔化之火，用在他的遺骸上。這火應該能讓倒下的地獄火重新活過來。",
    ["Warlocks tread dangerous ground in dealing with demons, but our demoniacs take this one step further. Through an ancient and arcane ritual, they allow a demon to enter their being."] = "術士與惡魔打交道，是在危險的地帶行走，但我們的惡魔信徒又更進一步。透過一場古老而神祕的儀式，他們讓惡魔進入自己的身體。",
    ["The demoniac seeks to embody power outright, not just possess it."] = "惡魔信徒追求的是直接化身為力量，而不只是擁有它。",
    ["The ultimate symbol of power amongst the tribe is the garb we wear in battle. A demoniac's robes have fused fine runecloth and devastatingly powerful mojo into a single fabric."] = "部族中力量的終極象徵，就是我們在戰鬥中穿的服裝。惡魔信徒的長袍把上等符文布和威力驚人的魔力融成了一塊織物。",
    ["My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with. Only the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro."] = "我的寵物快做好了。現在我只需要一些東西來填充它。只有沉沒的神廟裡那些食人妖的巫毒羽毛才行。牠們叫做加舍、米詹、佐羅、胡庫、祖洛和洛羅。",
    ["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."] = "我不裝模作樣，蛆蟲。瘟疫之心物品所蘊含的黑暗，很可能把我們兩個都毀掉。",
    ["Hey. Be careful 'round here. There be Dark Iron dwarves all around--looked like the Shadowforge clan. They just attacked the excavation site I was workin' at--killed nearly everyone there, including my boss Hammertoe."] = "嘿。在這附近要小心。到處都是黑鐵矮人——看起來是暗影熔爐氏族。他們剛攻擊了我工作的挖掘場——幾乎殺光了那裡所有人，包括我的老闆錘趾。",
    ["Talk to my friend, Furen Longbeard, in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He's the best shieldsmith you'll ever meet, and he owes me a big favor."] = "去暴風城矮人區找我的朋友弗倫·長鬚。他是你能遇到的最好的盾匠，而且他欠我一個大人情。",
    ["The Whirlwind Axe comes from an elemental trial a warrior has to complete alone. Three weapons come from the same chain and you keep only one."] = "旋風斧來自戰士必須獨自完成的元素試煉。同一條任務鏈會給出三件武器，你只能留下一件。",
    ["One of three weapons from the same solitary warrior trial. Choosing it means giving up the axe and the staff for good."] = "同一場戰士獨自試煉給出的三件武器之一。選擇它，就意味著永遠放棄那把斧頭和那根法杖。",
    ["Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you... A while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me."] = "是伯爾加德派你來的，對吧？沒錯，我這裡有備用武器，不過首先我有件事要你做……不久前，迪菲亞惡棍死牙傑克騙了我。",
    ["To pass this trial, you must travel south to the Field of Giants. There you will find a host of crawling, insect creatures. They are new to the Barrens and I do not like what they herald."] = "要通過這場試煉，你必須向南前往巨人之田。在那裡你會發現一大群爬行的昆蟲類生物。牠們是貧瘠之地的新來者，我不喜歡牠們所預示的東西。",
    ["I will give you a weapon, but first you must aid me. The Razormanes to the northwest came into my camp a few nights past."] = "我會給你一件武器，但你得先幫我。西北邊的鋼鬃野豬人幾個晚上前闖進了我的營地。",
    ["A crafted helm that outlived several tiers of raid gear. Its plans were the thing guilds actually fought over."] = "一頂製作而成的頭盔，比好幾個檔次的團隊裝備活得還久。公會真正爭奪的是它的圖樣。",
    ["Son of Blackhand and the last warchief of the Dark Horde, still holding Blackrock Spire long after the rest of the Horde moved on."] = "黑手之子，黑暗部落的最後一位大酋長，在其餘部落早已離去之後，仍長久守著黑石塔。",
    ["The vindicator's symbol of power is the breastplate."] = "守護者的力量象徵是胸甲。",
    ["Wreak havoc on the minions of evil. Zul'Gurub must taste Zandalar vengeance."] = "對邪惡的爪牙大肆破壞吧。祖爾格拉布必須嚐到贊達拉的復仇。",
    ["Vengeance is power. The Zandalar vindicator is such power."] = "復仇即是力量。贊達拉的守護者就是這樣的力量。",
    ["A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."] = "一個被迫為其拉效力的石巨人，會吸乾所有與他戰鬥之人的法力，吸滿後就變成岩石。",
    ["During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes."] = "在你於納克薩瑪斯與天災軍團交戰期間，如果遇到遭褻瀆的城垛和戰爭摧殘的板甲碎片，就帶回來給我，我會為你製作一件英雄所穿的護甲。",
}) do text[k] = v end
